(957057, 111309, 93, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you meant to go with the lighting scheme here, but it really doesn''t work for me.  The hand is too soft, and the remote control is hard to see. When you want your viewer focused on something,  it''s hard for them to respond if it''s buried in the background.  Also, for me, just a little weak on "communication"</td>', 'Perhaps you meant to go with the lighting scheme here, but it really doesn''t work for me.  The hand is too soft, and the remote control is hard to see. When you want your viewer focused on something,  it''s hard for them to respond if it''s buried in the background.  Also, for me, just a little weak on "communication"', '2004-10-13 04:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(957058, 112228, 93, '<td valign="top">hand looks a little soft and blurred.  Perhaps you were trying to capture it in motion, to simulate signing?  Doesn''t quite work for me.  I would have liked to have seen the texture of the surface more evenly throughout, as it''s pretty blown-out on the left, and would have looked lovely.</td>', 'hand looks a little soft and blurred.  Perhaps you were trying to capture it in motion, to simulate signing?  Doesn''t quite work for me.  I would have liked to have seen the texture of the surface more evenly throughout, as it''s pretty blown-out on the left, and would have looked lovely.', '2004-10-13 04:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(957059, 111604, 93, '<td valign="top">Maybe a touch too bright and saturated(in areas) in my opinion, although the red really speaks out.  Not very keen on the crop. Did you try different angles?</td>', 'Maybe a touch too bright and saturated(in areas) in my opinion, although the red really speaks out.  Not very keen on the crop. Did you try different angles?', '2004-10-13 04:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(957060, 112300, 21714, '<td valign="top">I quite like the composition - the way you have used space, lines and scale. However, I find the processing too harsh. Looks like you have gone a bit too far with sharpening.</td>', 'I quite like the composition - the way you have used space, lines and scale. However, I find the processing too harsh. Looks like you have gone a bit too far with sharpening.', '2004-10-13 04:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(957061, 112434, 93, '<td valign="top">Message in a bottle.  Problem for me is, the message you''re giving is that the bottle is secondary to the shot, and of little importance.  The out of focus, blurry waves (and flat lighting), occupy too much of this photo and leave the viewer (AKA me), wanting more.</td>', 'Message in a bottle.  Problem for me is, the message you''re giving is that the bottle is secondary to the shot, and of little importance.  The out of focus, blurry waves (and flat lighting), occupy too much of this photo and leave the viewer (AKA me), wanting more.', '2004-10-13 04:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(957064, 112046, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, and conveys your meaning well.  Lighting is a touch flat, and the sky quite noisy.  Not sure if it was a misty morning/evening, or if you just had to be zoomed in a bit too much, but the lighthouse suffers from a lack of contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'A nice shot, and conveys your meaning well.  Lighting is a touch flat, and the sky quite noisy.  Not sure if it was a misty morning/evening, or if you just had to be zoomed in a bit too much, but the lighthouse suffers from a lack of contrast and sharpness.', '2004-10-13 04:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(957067, 112243, 93, '<td valign="top">Your white balance seems a little off too me, and the lighting slightly harsh, especially in the upper right and on the buttons there.  It''s an OK shot of a phone, and definitely conveys communication, but remains just a little uninteresting.</td>', 'Your white balance seems a little off too me, and the lighting slightly harsh, especially in the upper right and on the buttons there.  It''s an OK shot of a phone, and definitely conveys communication, but remains just a little uninteresting.', '2004-10-13 04:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(957068, 112340, 93, '<td valign="top">more "snapshotty" than what I think you were probably going for.  The blow out of light off the shirt is extremely distracting, and the entire shot suffers from a lack of contrast.  Nice looking cast though.</td>', 'more "snapshotty" than what I think you were probably going for.  The blow out of light off the shirt is extremely distracting, and the entire shot suffers from a lack of contrast.  Nice looking cast though.', '2004-10-13 04:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(957069, 112483, 93, '<td valign="top">A very nice, tender moment captured.  The male''s hand is a touch soft, and I wish the fingernails hadn''t been painted as to blend with  the background, but the message is clear, and touching.</td>', 'A very nice, tender moment captured.  The male''s hand is a touch soft, and I wish the fingernails hadn''t been painted as to blend with  the background, but the message is clear, and touching.', '2004-10-13 04:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(957072, 112508, 93, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot!  Only complaint I have is that it''s a touch *too* dark, losing deatail on the microphone.  The blow-out you have on the bottom might have been helped by diffusing your light source.  A great moment captured though, and pulls me into the photo.</td>', 'I really like this shot!  Only complaint I have is that it''s a touch *too* dark, losing deatail on the microphone.  The blow-out you have on the bottom might have been helped by diffusing your light source.  A great moment captured though, and pulls me into the photo.', '2004-10-13 04:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(957074, 112051, 23913, '<td valign="top">nice pic. however i don''t like the overex. on what would be the camera body</td>', 'nice pic. however i don''t like the overex. on what would be the camera body', '2004-10-13 04:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(957075, 112468, 93, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous.  Perhaps a bit smooth, but could be an effect of the lighting.  A very classic moment.  Perhaps having a bit of writing already on the parchment could have sold the "communication" part of it a little better.. otherwise I''m left thinking, "they''re *about* to communicate.. but.."  That''s just a personal observation though, nothing to dock marks on.</td>', 'Simply gorgeous.  Perhaps a bit smooth, but could be an effect of the lighting.  A very classic moment.  Perhaps having a bit of writing already on the parchment could have sold the "communication" part of it a little better.. otherwise I''m left thinking, "they''re *about* to communicate.. but.."  That''s just a personal observation though, nothing to dock marks on.', '2004-10-13 04:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(957076, 112514, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice little candid moment.  Not enough contrast, and lighting is a bit dark.</td>', 'A nice little candid moment.  Not enough contrast, and lighting is a bit dark.', '2004-10-13 04:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(957078, 111424, 93, '<td valign="top">The expressions on the girls'' faces are wonderful.  I think this could have benefitted from a slight underexposure and an increase in contrast.  Otherwise, it''s a fun little candid moment, and sticks to the challenge well.</td>', 'The expressions on the girls'' faces are wonderful.  I think this could have benefitted from a slight underexposure and an increase in contrast.  Otherwise, it''s a fun little candid moment, and sticks to the challenge well.', '2004-10-13 04:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(957079, 111443, 93, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit, the newspapers seem to just jump off the screen.  This is a really great shot.</td>', 'Beautifully lit, the newspapers seem to just jump off the screen.  This is a really great shot.', '2004-10-13 04:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(957081, 112050, 93, '<td valign="top">I was expecting to see more of these shots than there are, and I love the angle you''ve chosen for this.  Usually, I''m a fan of sepia tones, but it seems to hinder this photograph a little, as the tonal range has been hurt by it.  The crop is *slightly* off balance as well, making for a touch of vertigo on my end.  Still, it *is* a nice, candid moment.</td>', 'I was expecting to see more of these shots than there are, and I love the angle you''ve chosen for this.  Usually, I''m a fan of sepia tones, but it seems to hinder this photograph a little, as the tonal range has been hurt by it.  The crop is *slightly* off balance as well, making for a touch of vertigo on my end.  Still, it *is* a nice, candid moment.', '2004-10-13 04:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
