(957178, 112187, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great shot, absolutely love it.  However I think that either you should have cropped it a bit tighter so that only the reflection of the sunset would show or have a wider shot wich includes the sunset, the waves at the top don´t add anything to this shot, in my humble opinion. 7</td>', 'Great shot, absolutely love it.  However I think that either you should have cropped it a bit tighter so that only the reflection of the sunset would show or have a wider shot wich includes the sunset, the waves at the top don´t add anything to this shot, in my humble opinion. 7', '2004-10-13 07:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(957181, 111972, 27586, '<td valign="top">A nice photo but the handle needs to be in or out of the shot. Too distracting.</td>', 'A nice photo but the handle needs to be in or out of the shot. Too distracting.', '2004-10-13 07:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(957182, 112422, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of this shot, how it comes from the back.</td>', 'I like the lighting of this shot, how it comes from the back.', '2004-10-13 07:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
