(957256, 111750, 25330, '<td valign="top">This is extraordinarily eye-catching because of the way the box is set into the wall (?)  For a moment I almost thought it was snow!  I think I might have bumped the sats a bit to make the reds a little redder.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is extraordinarily eye-catching because of the way the box is set into the wall (?)  For a moment I almost thought it was snow!  I think I might have bumped the sats a bit to make the reds a little redder.  Nicely done.', '2004-10-13 09:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(957259, 112139, 25330, '<td valign="top">There were more can-and-string shots than I expected in this challenge, but this is the best of the lot.  I love the DOF and the near can suspended with no visible means of support.  Also the Warholesque choice of soup.</td>', 'There were more can-and-string shots than I expected in this challenge, but this is the best of the lot.  I love the DOF and the near can suspended with no visible means of support.  Also the Warholesque choice of soup.', '2004-10-13 09:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(957263, 112170, 25330, '<td valign="top">This is a nice landscape but I think I might have bumped up the saturation a bit to bring out the fall colors.  It also feels like it''s a bit canted to the left.  I think I would have rotate a bit clockwise.</td>', 'This is a nice landscape but I think I might have bumped up the saturation a bit to bring out the fall colors.  It also feels like it''s a bit canted to the left.  I think I would have rotate a bit clockwise.', '2004-10-13 09:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(957266, 112163, 25330, '<td valign="top">This is a humorous concept, but the paper cup doesn''t do it for me.  Perhaps a tin can?  The whites are a bit pinkish on my monitor.  I think some curves adjustment would have helped.</td>', 'This is a humorous concept, but the paper cup doesn''t do it for me.  Perhaps a tin can?  The whites are a bit pinkish on my monitor.  I think some curves adjustment would have helped.', '2004-10-13 09:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(957267, 112501, 25330, '<td valign="top">I love imaged lit with a candle, but this is a bit too grainy for my taste.  If that was not intended maybe a longer exposure would have helped.</td>', 'I love imaged lit with a candle, but this is a bit too grainy for my taste.  If that was not intended maybe a longer exposure would have helped.', '2004-10-13 09:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(957269, 112293, 25330, '<td valign="top">I think this is a pair of communications cables of some sort.  But with no point of reference it''s difficult to tell.</td>', 'I think this is a pair of communications cables of some sort.  But with no point of reference it''s difficult to tell.', '2004-10-13 09:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(957271, 112398, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice soft light...good details.</td>', 'Nice soft light...good details.', '2004-10-13 09:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(957276, 112487, 318, '<td valign="top">Heh, my ''Touch'' idea. :)</td>', 'Heh, my ''Touch'' idea. :)', '2004-10-13 09:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
