(957284, 111922, 25330, '<td valign="top">The cat is striking, but I think I might have focused on the graffitist.</td>', 'The cat is striking, but I think I might have focused on the graffitist.', '2004-10-13 09:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(957285, 111962, 318, '<td valign="top">This would probably have gotten +1 if it was in black &amp; whit.</td>', 'This would probably have gotten +1 if it was in black & whit.', '2004-10-13 09:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(957286, 112434, 22533, '<td valign="top">GREAT idea, but the picture quality needs a litte work. Not sure what is not quite right. Waves aren''t quite right maybe? I understand the low light though. Maybe an even longer exposure time to give the waves that cool blur...</td>', 'GREAT idea, but the picture quality needs a litte work. Not sure what is not quite right. Waves aren''t quite right maybe? I understand the low light though. Maybe an even longer exposure time to give the waves that cool blur...', '2004-10-13 09:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(957287, 112296, 22533, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but a little out of focus....</td>', 'Great composition, but a little out of focus....', '2004-10-13 09:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(957288, 112176, 25330, '<td valign="top">A stunning sunset.  But I think the "communication" of the couple on the bench is lost in the rest of the picture.  I think I might have concentrated a little more on them at the expense of the beautiful clouds.</td>', 'A stunning sunset.  But I think the "communication" of the couple on the bench is lost in the rest of the picture.  I think I might have concentrated a little more on them at the expense of the beautiful clouds.', '2004-10-13 09:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(957289, 111472, 25330, '<td valign="top">As a longtime broadcaster I''ve been around towers all my life.  And they fascinate me particularly when partially obscured by clouds.  Nicely done!</td>', 'As a longtime broadcaster I''ve been around towers all my life.  And they fascinate me particularly when partially obscured by clouds.  Nicely done!', '2004-10-13 09:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(957290, 111063, 25330, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait.  But I don''t see what she''s communicating.  Except the obvious.</td>', 'A lovely portrait.  But I don''t see what she''s communicating.  Except the obvious.', '2004-10-13 09:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(957291, 111962, 22533, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but it might have been better if the real person was trying to talk to the others.....</td>', 'Cool idea, but it might have been better if the real person was trying to talk to the others.....', '2004-10-13 09:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(957293, 112190, 25330, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  I think I might have cropped a little tighter and lost some of the grass.  Otherwise nicely done!</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  I think I might have cropped a little tighter and lost some of the grass.  Otherwise nicely done!', '2004-10-13 09:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(957294, 111808, 27524, '<td valign="top">Well done...:) Good accent with colors.</td>', 'Well done...:) Good accent with colors.', '2004-10-13 09:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(957295, 112298, 26361, '<td valign="top">The baseball cards make a great background for the old radio.  Great photo!</td>', 'The baseball cards make a great background for the old radio.  Great photo!', '2004-10-13 09:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(957296, 112038, 22533, '<td valign="top">Great pic, but pic is too small.</td>', 'Great pic, but pic is too small.', '2004-10-13 09:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(957297, 111535, 25330, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily I like shallow depth, but this is too extreme.  Combined with the sunlit background, it makes the far character look too strange.  The near subject is nicely cropped.</td>', 'Ordinarily I like shallow depth, but this is too extreme.  Combined with the sunlit background, it makes the far character look too strange.  The near subject is nicely cropped.', '2004-10-13 09:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(957298, 112381, 22533, '<td valign="top">A well done interpretation of a common theme. Great lighting and a cute model. 8</td>', 'A well done interpretation of a common theme. Great lighting and a cute model. 8', '2004-10-13 09:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(957300, 110883, 22533, '<td valign="top">Is that really what it says? HA HA... great!</td>', 'Is that really what it says? HA HA... great!', '2004-10-13 09:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(957301, 112250, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s a good idea but there are several things that you could do better.  First the flare is a drawback, try taking from a different angle to reduce it.  Second it´s a bit underexposed and also you have too much empty space for such a simple backround.  Keep in mind though that this is only my humble opinion.</td>', 'It´s a good idea but there are several things that you could do better.  First the flare is a drawback, try taking from a different angle to reduce it.  Second it´s a bit underexposed and also you have too much empty space for such a simple backround.  Keep in mind though that this is only my humble opinion.', '2004-10-13 09:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(957302, 111205, 27524, '<td valign="top">:)Uhh... serious equipment...well done.</td>', ':)Uhh... serious equipment...well done.', '2004-10-13 09:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
