(957515, 112300, 20210, '<td valign="top">oof...I''m afraid this very good picture won''t do to well in this challenge.  the title is too subtle, I fear.  But maybe DPCers will prove me wrong!  I wish the perspective weren''t slightly askew on this, but a fantastic mood is captured here.</td>', 'oof...I''m afraid this very good picture won''t do to well in this challenge.  the title is too subtle, I fear.  But maybe DPCers will prove me wrong!  I wish the perspective weren''t slightly askew on this, but a fantastic mood is captured here.', '2004-10-13 11:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
