(957521, 111490, 25330, '<td valign="top">Focus is quite soft on the foreground subjects.  I suspect this was shot "from the hip" and you did what you could.</td>', 'Focus is quite soft on the foreground subjects.  I suspect this was shot "from the hip" and you did what you could.', '2004-10-13 11:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(957522, 112409, 20210, '<td valign="top">the shadows in this one are distracting.  And the geek in me cries out that the tin-can phone won''t work unless the line is drawn taught.  It looks like his shirt is coming untucked in an odd way. :)  But a technically good shot, great expression captured.</td>', 'the shadows in this one are distracting.  And the geek in me cries out that the tin-can phone won''t work unless the line is drawn taught.  It looks like his shirt is coming untucked in an odd way. :)  But a technically good shot, great expression captured.', '2004-10-13 11:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(957525, 112272, 25330, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t figure out what this was at first--and I hate to have to think too hard ;&gt;.  Maybe a slight change of shooting angle would have made the knife stand out more.</td>', 'I couldn''t figure out what this was at first--and I hate to have to think too hard ;>.  Maybe a slight change of shooting angle would have made the knife stand out more.', '2004-10-13 11:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(957526, 111492, 22533, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the DOF. Good job.</td>', 'I love the color and the DOF. Good job.', '2004-10-13 11:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(957528, 112211, 25330, '<td valign="top">That''s a damn nice look.  Message received.  And a nicely done photograph too.</td>', 'That''s a damn nice look.  Message received.  And a nicely done photograph too.', '2004-10-13 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
