(958093, 111600, 24065, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is a great subject, well focused, but could use some more cropping on the right.  The blue/green area distracts me and pulls my eyes away from what I think should be the main focus.   If the white wall had kind of faded into blackness I would have rated it higher.  Thanks for thinking creatively!  All those tin cans, cell phones &amp; towers are getting hard to look at!</td>', 'In my opinion this is a great subject, well focused, but could use some more cropping on the right.  The blue/green area distracts me and pulls my eyes away from what I think should be the main focus.   If the white wall had kind of faded into blackness I would have rated it higher.  Thanks for thinking creatively!  All those tin cans, cell phones & towers are getting hard to look at!', '2004-10-13 16:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
