(958753, 112389, 24511, '<td valign="top">I don''t kwow if this photo would scare potential dpchallenge recruits but it is the most well known means of communication out there.  I find the visual much more negative than the spoken word that can express astonishment, praise and even bliss.  Excellent Challenge entry.  You need two or more to communicate this symbol.  At the risk of reputation and lowering standards,  my artistic gut give you a 9.  Great focus, loved the blurred background, get your nails trimmed.  I''d thank you but you just told me off.</td>', 'I don''t kwow if this photo would scare potential dpchallenge recruits but it is the most well known means of communication out there.  I find the visual much more negative than the spoken word that can express astonishment, praise and even bliss.  Excellent Challenge entry.  You need two or more to communicate this symbol.  At the risk of reputation and lowering standards,  my artistic gut give you a 9.  Great focus, loved the blurred background, get your nails trimmed.  I''d thank you but you just told me off.', '2004-10-14 01:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
