(959619, 112409, 93, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the better "can-on-a-string" photographs in the challenge.  The duotone is just a little too strong for me, but I love the lighting. Great contrast between the two forms of communication devices here.  Overall, a strong image, amusing, and well shot.  Good work.</td>', 'Definitely one of the better "can-on-a-string" photographs in the challenge.  The duotone is just a little too strong for me, but I love the lighting. Great contrast between the two forms of communication devices here.  Overall, a strong image, amusing, and well shot.  Good work.', '2004-10-14 16:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(959622, 111063, 7889, '<td valign="top">This picture communicates great beauty and charm. Her eyes are amazing and her face is just wonderful. I love the lighting and the dof, I would have preferred it withouth the orange garment but that is a minor detail. Going in my favourites. good luck to you</td>', 'This picture communicates great beauty and charm. Her eyes are amazing and her face is just wonderful. I love the lighting and the dof, I would have preferred it withouth the orange garment but that is a minor detail. Going in my favourites. good luck to you', '2004-10-14 16:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(959623, 112263, 93, '<td valign="top">Composition is good on this shot, but I find it rather lacking in lighting.  The sky is very noisy, and the overall appearance is just a little flat.  You''ve really nailed the symmetry.</td>', 'Composition is good on this shot, but I find it rather lacking in lighting.  The sky is very noisy, and the overall appearance is just a little flat.  You''ve really nailed the symmetry.', '2004-10-14 16:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(959624, 112211, 7889, '<td valign="top">This is a decent photo which could have been improved with a better background. Its a bit untidy for me. Good luck</td>', 'This is a decent photo which could have been improved with a better background. Its a bit untidy for me. Good luck', '2004-10-14 16:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(959627, 112381, 93, '<td valign="top">lighting is a little too harsh here, it looks as if you might have metered on a darker area of the photo (or chose a couple of stops too high).  The child''s expression and the composition are really good here, but with proper lighting, this could really have "shone". (pardon the pun), and have been an 8 or a 9.</td>', 'lighting is a little too harsh here, it looks as if you might have metered on a darker area of the photo (or chose a couple of stops too high).  The child''s expression and the composition are really good here, but with proper lighting, this could really have "shone". (pardon the pun), and have been an 8 or a 9.', '2004-10-14 16:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(959630, 111317, 7778, '<td valign="top">I embrace the idea for this image, enjoy the aesthetics of notes and paper against the black space which surrounds it, appreciate the compositional sense. <br/> <br/>The ornate candle holder (despite a potential connotation with the ''baroqueness of opera) , however, vs. the retro ''mode'' of the inserted border, exceeds my capacity for appreciation.<br/> <br/>What is left, to me, is a potentially satisfying image (with excellent technical attributes, especially via exposure) that has been reduced to a sentimentality.</td>', 'I embrace the idea for this image, enjoy the aesthetics of notes and paper against the black space which surrounds it, appreciate the compositional sense.  The ornate candle holder (despite a potential connotation with the ''baroqueness of opera) , however, vs. the retro ''mode'' of the inserted border, exceeds my capacity for appreciation. What is left, to me, is a potentially satisfying image (with excellent technical attributes, especially via exposure) that has been reduced to a sentimentality.', '2004-10-14 16:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(959634, 112351, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice studio attempt. I think the crop is a little tight at the top and bottom, and you''ve got some vignetting in the two right corners.  The focus falls off in wierd places as well, and the lighting seems to be a bit flat.  You''ve got a good angle on the subject though, and for the most part the clarity is good.  Keep working on these types of shots.. I know *I* am :)</td>', 'A nice studio attempt. I think the crop is a little tight at the top and bottom, and you''ve got some vignetting in the two right corners.  The focus falls off in wierd places as well, and the lighting seems to be a bit flat.  You''ve got a good angle on the subject though, and for the most part the clarity is good.  Keep working on these types of shots.. I know *I* am :)', '2004-10-14 16:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(959636, 112197, 5746, '<td valign="top">I came back again to this picture. I don''t perceive it as a portrait anymore. The street sign could be grafitti and his gesture as well. I think I know what was on your mind. Bump it up to 10. This photo is too good to be overlooked.</td>', 'I came back again to this picture. I don''t perceive it as a portrait anymore. The street sign could be grafitti and his gesture as well. I think I know what was on your mind. Bump it up to 10. This photo is too good to be overlooked.', '2004-10-14 16:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(959637, 112258, 24925, '<td valign="top">Although this meets the challenge, I don''t find it to be an interesting photograph.  I sure wish I owned all those books, though!</td>', 'Although this meets the challenge, I don''t find it to be an interesting photograph.  I sure wish I owned all those books, though!', '2004-10-14 16:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(959638, 112252, 93, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I''m sure the yellow tones are purposeful, but I find it a little hard to look at. The photos are especially hurt by the toning, as they become washed out a bit, from what I see.   It''s a touching photograph though.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I''m sure the yellow tones are purposeful, but I find it a little hard to look at. The photos are especially hurt by the toning, as they become washed out a bit, from what I see.   It''s a touching photograph though.', '2004-10-14 16:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(959644, 112313, 93, '<td valign="top">Definitely different, and meets the challenge on the most basic of levels.  The hue shifting, however,  is just not to my taste.  Pretty dynamic piece of graphic art in my opinion, but not something I generally score high.</td>', 'Definitely different, and meets the challenge on the most basic of levels.  The hue shifting, however,  is just not to my taste.  Pretty dynamic piece of graphic art in my opinion, but not something I generally score high.', '2004-10-14 16:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(959648, 112201, 93, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, to a point, but the photograph itself has a few problems.  It''s dark, out of focus on the fish candies, and very flat and plain. Not really my brand of humor either.  Keep trying.</td>', 'I like the concept, to a point, but the photograph itself has a few problems.  It''s dark, out of focus on the fish candies, and very flat and plain. Not really my brand of humor either.  Keep trying.', '2004-10-14 17:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(959652, 112038, 7778, '<td valign="top">Due to its minute size the image is nearly impossible to evaluate and enjoy. The capture appears to be worthwhile, rich with colour and emotional sense. The composition too appears apt and pleasing. The exposure is plain difficult to appreciate without access to its detailed effects.<br/> <br/>I like the feeling it communicates and welcome both title and idea in this challenge.</td>', 'Due to its minute size the image is nearly impossible to evaluate and enjoy. The capture appears to be worthwhile, rich with colour and emotional sense. The composition too appears apt and pleasing. The exposure is plain difficult to appreciate without access to its detailed effects. I like the feeling it communicates and welcome both title and idea in this challenge.', '2004-10-14 17:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(959653, 112182, 24715, '<td valign="top">Image could be larger and sharper. Good angle chosen to avoid topling over effect.</td>', 'Image could be larger and sharper. Good angle chosen to avoid topling over effect.', '2004-10-14 17:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(959666, 111322, 6667, '<td valign="top">Winchester 30-30?</td>', 'Winchester 30-30?', '2004-10-14 17:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(959681, 112038, 6667, '<td valign="top">\"Walk,\" my father used to say,<br/>\"don'' talk.\"<br/>\"Words,\" my father used to say,<br/>\"scare birds.\"  <br/> <br/>David McCord<br/> <br/>I think your picture is fantastic: color saturation,  composition, theme, depth of field.  But (and I think you know what''s coming)  the size is way too small.  Was there no way to enlarge it?!  BOL</td>', '\"Walk,\" my father used to say,\"don'' talk.\"\"Words,\" my father used to say,\"scare birds.\"   David McCord I think your picture is fantastic: color saturation,  composition, theme, depth of field.  But (and I think you know what''s coming)  the size is way too small.  Was there no way to enlarge it?!  BOL', '2004-10-14 17:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(959692, 112371, 6667, '<td valign="top">Great capture.   I had second thoughts on this one a bumped it up.  The young ladies enthusiasm got to me too.</td>', 'Great capture.   I had second thoughts on this one a bumped it up.  The young ladies enthusiasm got to me too.', '2004-10-14 17:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(959695, 111542, 22781, '<td valign="top">Yep, I like this one. A real change between all these boring pictures of empty cans...<br/>It''s not perfect, the background looks a bit wrinkled and the High-key effect looks not realy 100% to me, but I''ll score you 8 now, and revisit it later, maybe score you even higher...</td>', 'Yep, I like this one. A real change between all these boring pictures of empty cans...It''s not perfect, the background looks a bit wrinkled and the High-key effect looks not realy 100% to me, but I''ll score you 8 now, and revisit it later, maybe score you even higher...', '2004-10-14 17:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(959696, 111063, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice girl, but I dont get it....<br/>What has this to do with communication?</td>', 'Nice girl, but I dont get it....What has this to do with communication?', '2004-10-14 17:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(959715, 111142, 20679, '<td valign="top">Focus could be a little sharper in the near field</td>', 'Focus could be a little sharper in the near field', '2004-10-14 17:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
