(959725, 112400, 20679, '<td valign="top">nice idea. Would be better if we didn''t see the shadows on the background so that the hands look as if they are floating more. Lighting is a little hard, coming from the front.</td>', 'nice idea. Would be better if we didn''t see the shadows on the background so that the hands look as if they are floating more. Lighting is a little hard, coming from the front.', '2004-10-14 18:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(959727, 112443, 20679, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to do, but a greater depth of field would keep the words and paper in focus. Tyr using a smaller aperture (higher f number) which would probably mean a longer exposure, so a tripod is almost essential.</td>', 'It''s hard to do, but a greater depth of field would keep the words and paper in focus. Tyr using a smaller aperture (higher f number) which would probably mean a longer exposure, so a tripod is almost essential.', '2004-10-14 18:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
