(959790, 111858, 22970, '<td valign="top">I see what kind of effect you were striving for but it just didnt develop well. I think you should of held the hand that was doing the writing a second or so longer where we could of seen it better. I also think you should of taken the picture from the opposite angle. From bottom to top that way if the effect would have developed the way you wanted we [the voters] would be able to view your picture from the perspective of the person doing the reading and writing.</td>', 'I see what kind of effect you were striving for but it just didnt develop well. I think you should of held the hand that was doing the writing a second or so longer where we could of seen it better. I also think you should of taken the picture from the opposite angle. From bottom to top that way if the effect would have developed the way you wanted we [the voters] would be able to view your picture from the perspective of the person doing the reading and writing.', '2004-10-14 18:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
