(960311, 112389, 25217, '<td valign="top">Is the background a car? Whatever it is, the colors are nice and really help make the finger stand out (cool colors stay in the back, warm colors come up front).</td>', 'Is the background a car? Whatever it is, the colors are nice and really help make the finger stand out (cool colors stay in the back, warm colors come up front).', '2004-10-15 02:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
