(960329, 112175, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good concept and nice sunset but not detailed enough to get your concept to work properly for you.</td>', 'Good concept and nice sunset but not detailed enough to get your concept to work properly for you.', '2004-10-15 03:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(960330, 112517, 14202, '<td valign="top">I really like this, just wonder if the colour and lighting on the phone could have been ''tweaked'' just a little bit more?  Love the off-set compositon</td>', 'I really like this, just wonder if the colour and lighting on the phone could have been ''tweaked'' just a little bit more?  Love the off-set compositon', '2004-10-15 03:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(960331, 110883, 14202, '<td valign="top">The b&amp;w really works with this shot...well done.</td>', 'The b&w really works with this shot...well done.', '2004-10-15 03:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(960332, 112263, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry</td>', 'Good symmetry', '2004-10-15 03:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(960333, 112313, 4267, '<td valign="top">overprocessed... this is really digital art not photography</td>', 'overprocessed... this is really digital art not photography', '2004-10-15 03:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(960335, 112114, 14202, '<td valign="top">I love the off-set composition but the overall lighting and photo itself needs something.  The ''rough'' foreground drags this down I feel.</td>', 'I love the off-set composition but the overall lighting and photo itself needs something.  The ''rough'' foreground drags this down I feel.', '2004-10-15 03:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(960337, 112498, 14202, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but find this a bit flat, clinical almost...maybe a bit more tweak with lighting or something...</td>', 'I like the idea, but find this a bit flat, clinical almost...maybe a bit more tweak with lighting or something...', '2004-10-15 03:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(960338, 110883, 24486, '<td valign="top">Very effective</td>', 'Very effective', '2004-10-15 03:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(960340, 112191, 24486, '<td valign="top">Your choice to go B &amp; W works well here as does your frame</td>', 'Your choice to go B & W works well here as does your frame', '2004-10-15 03:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(960341, 112456, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is actually kind of a scary photo, although that probably wasn''t your intent.  I think it''s the cutting off at the top, and darkness that does it.  Reminds me of a horror flick.</td>', 'This is actually kind of a scary photo, although that probably wasn''t your intent.  I think it''s the cutting off at the top, and darkness that does it.  Reminds me of a horror flick.', '2004-10-15 03:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(960343, 112187, 12151, '<td valign="top">I might like this better without the bottle, to be honest!  But I like the colors.  Great environment and timing for the shot.</td>', 'I might like this better without the bottle, to be honest!  But I like the colors.  Great environment and timing for the shot.', '2004-10-15 03:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(960348, 112513, 12151, '<td valign="top">I think this works for the guy on the right, but not so much the guy on the left.  The guy on the left looks like he was smooshed, which doesn''t appeal to me, while the guy on the right looks whole despite his motion blur, which does appeal to me.</td>', 'I think this works for the guy on the right, but not so much the guy on the left.  The guy on the left looks like he was smooshed, which doesn''t appeal to me, while the guy on the right looks whole despite his motion blur, which does appeal to me.', '2004-10-15 03:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(960357, 112389, 24486, '<td valign="top">Well it''s certainly an in your face image &amp; probably one of the most universally recognised hand signals. I  would of liked to of seen the steering wheel a little more in focus .Your frame works well here.</td>', 'Well it''s certainly an in your face image & probably one of the most universally recognised hand signals. I  would of liked to of seen the steering wheel a little more in focus .Your frame works well here.', '2004-10-15 03:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(960365, 112423, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice concept, but the photograph is lacking a touch technically, IMO.  It''s a little over-exposed, with a flat feel (not enough contrast).  White balance seems to be off, as the geese/ducks are bluish tinged, and the sign seems to have a great deal of artifacting in the red.  A couple of extra shots at a few more stops down, or with exposure compensation dialed down a bit, might have given you something more to work with, and a little more post-editing work would have also done wonders.  Still, I like the concept, and the composition is nice. The fence is unfortunate, but out of your hands.  Keep up the good work, and keep shooting.</td>', 'A nice concept, but the photograph is lacking a touch technically, IMO.  It''s a little over-exposed, with a flat feel (not enough contrast).  White balance seems to be off, as the geese/ducks are bluish tinged, and the sign seems to have a great deal of artifacting in the red.  A couple of extra shots at a few more stops down, or with exposure compensation dialed down a bit, might have given you something more to work with, and a little more post-editing work would have also done wonders.  Still, I like the concept, and the composition is nice. The fence is unfortunate, but out of your hands.  Keep up the good work, and keep shooting.', '2004-10-15 04:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(960367, 111660, 93, '<td valign="top">Just a little flat for me. No real point of interest.  The headline ties you into the challenge, but it''s certainly not a pretty photograph.  I think, had you turned this into a B&amp;W shot.. the gritty nature would have worked.. but in color, it''s just too mundane.</td>', 'Just a little flat for me. No real point of interest.  The headline ties you into the challenge, but it''s certainly not a pretty photograph.  I think, had you turned this into a B&W shot.. the gritty nature would have worked.. but in color, it''s just too mundane.', '2004-10-15 04:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(960368, 112155, 93, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and it''s got a nice feel, but I''m just personally not that attracted to the "graphic art" look.  No fault of your own, so good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Good idea, and it''s got a nice feel, but I''m just personally not that attracted to the "graphic art" look.  No fault of your own, so good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-15 04:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(960369, 112422, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully captured still.. lighting is quite nice, and clarity is wonderful.  Something about the composition, however, just leaves me wanting a little more.. although, the more I sit here looking at it.. the more it grows on me.  I might have to come back to this one.</td>', 'This is a beautifully captured still.. lighting is quite nice, and clarity is wonderful.  Something about the composition, however, just leaves me wanting a little more.. although, the more I sit here looking at it.. the more it grows on me.  I might have to come back to this one.', '2004-10-15 04:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(960370, 111861, 93, '<td valign="top">Religious themed photographs don''t tend to do well on DPC, and I''m betting this shot is no exception, but feel free to let me know if I''m wrong.  Now, *I* don''t have a problem with it, but I *do* have a problem with the cross on the bible page.  To me, it ruins the feel of the photograph, the light it is reflecting is harsh and distracting, and I don''t think it really serves a purpose for the challenge (you filled that role with the bible).  It might, to other people, also come across as the preachy straw that broke the camel''s back.   Nice lighting on the page, and good clarity and DOF.  Get rid of the cross, and it would be a higher vote from me.</td>', 'Religious themed photographs don''t tend to do well on DPC, and I''m betting this shot is no exception, but feel free to let me know if I''m wrong.  Now, *I* don''t have a problem with it, but I *do* have a problem with the cross on the bible page.  To me, it ruins the feel of the photograph, the light it is reflecting is harsh and distracting, and I don''t think it really serves a purpose for the challenge (you filled that role with the bible).  It might, to other people, also come across as the preachy straw that broke the camel''s back.   Nice lighting on the page, and good clarity and DOF.  Get rid of the cross, and it would be a higher vote from me.', '2004-10-15 04:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(960371, 111472, 93, '<td valign="top">gritty, dark, and semi-powerful..  the lines are very dynamic. If only lightning could strike! :)  I like this, simple, but not.</td>', 'gritty, dark, and semi-powerful..  the lines are very dynamic. If only lightning could strike! :)  I like this, simple, but not.', '2004-10-15 04:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(960372, 111431, 93, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where you found an old switchboard, but cool.  The shot is a little flat in the lighting, but I like the crop and angle. (except maybe I would have cropped the top off more.. but I''m no expert).  Come in Tokyo!</td>', 'I don''t know where you found an old switchboard, but cool.  The shot is a little flat in the lighting, but I like the crop and angle. (except maybe I would have cropped the top off more.. but I''m no expert).  Come in Tokyo!', '2004-10-15 04:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(960374, 112413, 93, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. This is the first shot of a library I''ve seen.  Lighting is a bit harsh in the corner,  maybe metering in a darker area would have helped?  The composition is interesting, but not fantastic.  Did you play around a lot with different views and angles?  It can be fun to shoot from the floor in a library :)</td>', 'Interesting idea. This is the first shot of a library I''ve seen.  Lighting is a bit harsh in the corner,  maybe metering in a darker area would have helped?  The composition is interesting, but not fantastic.  Did you play around a lot with different views and angles?  It can be fun to shoot from the floor in a library :)', '2004-10-15 04:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(960377, 110883, 93, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Love it.  Nice lighting, composition, and idea.  This is a really strong and simple shot. Great work.</td>', 'LOL.  Love it.  Nice lighting, composition, and idea.  This is a really strong and simple shot. Great work.', '2004-10-15 04:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(960378, 112317, 93, '<td valign="top">Just a little too chaotic for me.  Lighting and clarity are wonderful. The colors are strong and rich, but the angle and helter skelter composition keep this from being a really good photograph, in my eyes.</td>', 'Just a little too chaotic for me.  Lighting and clarity are wonderful. The colors are strong and rich, but the angle and helter skelter composition keep this from being a really good photograph, in my eyes.', '2004-10-15 04:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(960379, 112296, 93, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the camer and lens.  The sepia works, but I think it''s also a tad strong.  A diffuser on your flash/lighting would have helped the glare from the lens as well.</td>', 'A little soft on the camer and lens.  The sepia works, but I think it''s also a tad strong.  A diffuser on your flash/lighting would have helped the glare from the lens as well.', '2004-10-15 04:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(960380, 111685, 93, '<td valign="top">very disturbingly fun concept.  I like the red, gives the impression of blood.   An improvement for me on this shot would have been "blood like" rivulets sliding down the glass from the bottom of the letters.</td>', 'very disturbingly fun concept.  I like the red, gives the impression of blood.   An improvement for me on this shot would have been "blood like" rivulets sliding down the glass from the bottom of the letters.', '2004-10-15 04:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(960381, 111945, 93, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the most successful way that babies communicate, lord knows I get my fair share.  This is a nice shot.  The face is a little soft, it looks like the camera back focused onto the towel, which is unfortunate.  Lighting is good, but you could have used another source on the right side.  She''s (I assume, the shirt looks feminine), a cutie though, so I have no doubt you''ll keep practicing :)</td>', 'Perhaps the most successful way that babies communicate, lord knows I get my fair share.  This is a nice shot.  The face is a little soft, it looks like the camera back focused onto the towel, which is unfortunate.  Lighting is good, but you could have used another source on the right side.  She''s (I assume, the shirt looks feminine), a cutie though, so I have no doubt you''ll keep practicing :)', '2004-10-15 04:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(960382, 112473, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  The "degenerative" effect on this shot really works for me, and the DOF is awesome.  The lighting, while harsh, seems to work.  Just that top right corner that detracts a bit, but not too much.. Good work.</td>', 'Nice concept.  The "degenerative" effect on this shot really works for me, and the DOF is awesome.  The lighting, while harsh, seems to work.  Just that top right corner that detracts a bit, but not too much.. Good work.', '2004-10-15 04:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(960383, 112420, 93, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, while I like the idea, the background you have here is far to distracting and cluttered.  I realize you may have been going for a candid, natural moment, but for me, I just can''t concentrate on what is trying to be communicated here.  The foreground is also pretty soft, which doesn''t help distinguish it from the clutter.</td>', 'Unfortunately, while I like the idea, the background you have here is far to distracting and cluttered.  I realize you may have been going for a candid, natural moment, but for me, I just can''t concentrate on what is trying to be communicated here.  The foreground is also pretty soft, which doesn''t help distinguish it from the clutter.', '2004-10-15 04:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(960384, 110697, 93, '<td valign="top">We should all be so lucky to be privvy to a communications room :)  Nice shot, but a little soft, losing detail.</td>', 'We should all be so lucky to be privvy to a communications room :)  Nice shot, but a little soft, losing detail.', '2004-10-15 04:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(960385, 112350, 93, '<td valign="top">Not the strongest on the challenge IMO.  I don''t feel a communicative nature here, although it is a nice tender moment.  Had the models been looking at each other, it would have helped sell it.</td>', 'Not the strongest on the challenge IMO.  I don''t feel a communicative nature here, although it is a nice tender moment.  Had the models been looking at each other, it would have helped sell it.', '2004-10-15 04:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(960387, 111846, 93, '<td valign="top">A little young aren''t they!?  haha.. nice expression.  A little soft on tthe faces, and the lighting seems a touch hard, making it more "snapshotty" than otherwise.  I like the humor though.</td>', 'A little young aren''t they!?  haha.. nice expression.  A little soft on tthe faces, and the lighting seems a touch hard, making it more "snapshotty" than otherwise.  I like the humor though.', '2004-10-15 04:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(960389, 112347, 93, '<td valign="top">The woman in the foreground turns this from a photograph, into a snapshot.  She''s distracting, and doesn''t contribute to the theme or the composition.  Another angle showing more of the vendor would have really helped as well, as the clarity and lighting on him, and the booth, is nice.  All of this is, of course, just my opinion.</td>', 'The woman in the foreground turns this from a photograph, into a snapshot.  She''s distracting, and doesn''t contribute to the theme or the composition.  Another angle showing more of the vendor would have really helped as well, as the clarity and lighting on him, and the booth, is nice.  All of this is, of course, just my opinion.', '2004-10-15 04:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(960390, 111640, 93, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic shot.  Looks like you had a polarizing lens on, or you simulated on in post.  The dark blue of the sky helps bring out the lines of the structure, and the fall colors in the background are really nice.  Now if you could just magically make the people disappear, you could have a *really* nice stock photo ;) lol.  Good job, and good eye.</td>', 'Very dynamic shot.  Looks like you had a polarizing lens on, or you simulated on in post.  The dark blue of the sky helps bring out the lines of the structure, and the fall colors in the background are really nice.  Now if you could just magically make the people disappear, you could have a *really* nice stock photo ;) lol.  Good job, and good eye.', '2004-10-15 04:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(960392, 112416, 9389, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  One of my favorites.  Excellent use of backlighting... and in this case, the overexposure adds to the effect.</td>', 'I love this shot.  One of my favorites.  Excellent use of backlighting... and in this case, the overexposure adds to the effect.', '2004-10-15 05:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(960393, 112412, 93, '<td valign="top">Gee.. someone talking on the phone for a communication challenge ;)<br/> <br/>Nice shot. I like how your lighting is actually not "perfect", as it contributes to the feel of someone lying by their bedside lamp.  Nice clarity.  Composition is ok, but not *great*.. She just seems to be up too high, and the bed post is kind of distracting to me.</td>', 'Gee.. someone talking on the phone for a communication challenge ;) Nice shot. I like how your lighting is actually not "perfect", as it contributes to the feel of someone lying by their bedside lamp.  Nice clarity.  Composition is ok, but not *great*.. She just seems to be up too high, and the bed post is kind of distracting to me.', '2004-10-15 05:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(960394, 112148, 9389, '<td valign="top">Great composition and use of b&amp;w</td>', 'Great composition and use of b&w', '2004-10-15 05:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(960395, 111205, 93, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful shot, and a great use of desat.  I really like the angle you''ve chosen, and gotten some fantastic contrast and clarity.  The only problem I have with it is.. the modern tile surface ;)   You needed to hitch this baby to your back and drag it to a desert or grasslands!</td>', 'this is a beautiful shot, and a great use of desat.  I really like the angle you''ve chosen, and gotten some fantastic contrast and clarity.  The only problem I have with it is.. the modern tile surface ;)   You needed to hitch this baby to your back and drag it to a desert or grasslands!', '2004-10-15 05:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(960397, 111453, 93, '<td valign="top">This is just too much like a snapshot.  out of focus, skewed composition, uninteresting crop, etc.  A good idea, but a lazy execution.</td>', 'This is just too much like a snapshot.  out of focus, skewed composition, uninteresting crop, etc.  A good idea, but a lazy execution.', '2004-10-15 05:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(960398, 111062, 93, '<td valign="top">No idea what you''re trying to say with this.  A Capitol building is hardly "communication" to me.  Maybe the senate floor.. or somone on the phone in their office.. or a meeting between diplomats.. <br/>Not really the place for political meanderings :)</td>', 'No idea what you''re trying to say with this.  A Capitol building is hardly "communication" to me.  Maybe the senate floor.. or somone on the phone in their office.. or a meeting between diplomats.. Not really the place for political meanderings :)', '2004-10-15 05:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(960404, 111741, 24983, '<td valign="top">This is something that we take for granted and no one else saw, well done i think it really fits the bill</td>', 'This is something that we take for granted and no one else saw, well done i think it really fits the bill', '2004-10-15 05:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(960407, 112296, 24983, '<td valign="top">great I thnought I was thwe only one to think of this</td>', 'great I thnought I was thwe only one to think of this', '2004-10-15 05:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(960409, 112513, 24983, '<td valign="top">dirrerent but aq real winner it really meets the challenge.</td>', 'dirrerent but aq real winner it really meets the challenge.', '2004-10-15 05:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
