(961629, 111184, 27847, '<td valign="top">Love the picture, but I think it''s the idea of a carrier pigeon that just makes this picture ever greater. "Mail that never rests; high and low, far and wide".</td>', 'Love the picture, but I think it''s the idea of a carrier pigeon that just makes this picture ever greater. "Mail that never rests; high and low, far and wide".', '2004-10-16 11:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(961630, 112119, 24363, '<td valign="top">the glasses should have been taken off<br/></td>', 'the glasses should have been taken off', '2004-10-16 11:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(961633, 111991, 27847, '<td valign="top">Intense, dramatic and extreme; as you have mentioned. Finding an old telegraph machine must have been difficult. The electric spark really makes this picture. Hope no one got hurt ;-)</td>', 'Intense, dramatic and extreme; as you have mentioned. Finding an old telegraph machine must have been difficult. The electric spark really makes this picture. Hope no one got hurt ;-)', '2004-10-16 11:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(961634, 112093, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured body language.  Hope people get this.  I give this a ten.</td>', 'Beautifully captured body language.  Hope people get this.  I give this a ten.', '2004-10-16 12:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(961635, 112497, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good capture!  The golden light is gorgeous.</td>', 'Good capture!  The golden light is gorgeous.', '2004-10-16 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(961636, 112187, 12962, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.  The mood created is hopeful.  9.</td>', 'Love the colors.  The mood created is hopeful.  9.', '2004-10-16 12:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(961637, 112114, 12962, '<td valign="top">Wow.  What else there is to say?</td>', 'Wow.  What else there is to say?', '2004-10-16 12:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(961638, 112119, 27847, '<td valign="top">The focus in this picture, rocks! I love the prop also, nice microphone! Just brings you back to the 30''s, 40''s and radio broadcasting.  Well, not really since I wasn''t born near that time, but...</td>', 'The focus in this picture, rocks! I love the prop also, nice microphone! Just brings you back to the 30''s, 40''s and radio broadcasting.  Well, not really since I wasn''t born near that time, but...', '2004-10-16 12:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(961639, 111808, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the challenge.  Colors are great.  Sky is absolutely gorgeous.</td>', 'Good interpretation of the challenge.  Colors are great.  Sky is absolutely gorgeous.', '2004-10-16 12:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(961640, 112265, 25143, '<td valign="top">nicely captured and very effective in the color juxtaposition</td>', 'nicely captured and very effective in the color juxtaposition', '2004-10-16 12:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(961641, 112509, 25143, '<td valign="top">very Matrix !!</td>', 'very Matrix !!', '2004-10-16 12:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(961643, 112000, 25143, '<td valign="top">good riddance to the TV - give me the world any day ... nice idea</td>', 'good riddance to the TV - give me the world any day ... nice idea', '2004-10-16 12:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(961644, 112412, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice story here.  Perfect capture of a teenaged daughter.  I love her expression and her crossed leg position.  9.</td>', 'Nice story here.  Perfect capture of a teenaged daughter.  I love her expression and her crossed leg position.  9.', '2004-10-16 12:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(961645, 112114, 25143, '<td valign="top">not enough visual focus on the theme, too much foreground distraction and the light is a bit too yellow for my taste - I like the general idea though</td>', 'not enough visual focus on the theme, too much foreground distraction and the light is a bit too yellow for my taste - I like the general idea though', '2004-10-16 12:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(961646, 112514, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful expressions you''ve captured here.  I suggest that you crop tightly, zooming into the faces to give more impact to an already excellent capture.</td>', 'Beautiful expressions you''ve captured here.  I suggest that you crop tightly, zooming into the faces to give more impact to an already excellent capture.', '2004-10-16 12:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(961647, 111808, 27847, '<td valign="top">Powerful idea! I really like the whole concept of this picture. The focus throughout the whole picture is great. Also, looks like you picked a great background. Nothing like the great outdoors with a perfect sky.</td>', 'Powerful idea! I really like the whole concept of this picture. The focus throughout the whole picture is great. Also, looks like you picked a great background. Nothing like the great outdoors with a perfect sky.', '2004-10-16 12:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(961648, 112236, 12962, '<td valign="top">Gives smile to a hopeless romantic like me. 10.</td>', 'Gives smile to a hopeless romantic like me. 10.', '2004-10-16 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(961650, 111492, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very strong graphic design elements and composition.  Ten.</td>', 'Very strong graphic design elements and composition.  Ten.', '2004-10-16 12:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(961651, 112338, 12962, '<td valign="top">Red, black and some white make very attractive graphic design colors as this photograph reels you in.  Good job!  (The redhead also is a wonderful touch.)</td>', 'Red, black and some white make very attractive graphic design colors as this photograph reels you in.  Good job!  (The redhead also is a wonderful touch.)', '2004-10-16 12:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(961652, 112473, 12962, '<td valign="top">DOF is just wonderful.</td>', 'DOF is just wonderful.', '2004-10-16 12:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(961654, 112059, 12962, '<td valign="top">Love the strong blue background.  I would crop from the bottom to remove the purple fringing.</td>', 'Love the strong blue background.  I would crop from the bottom to remove the purple fringing.', '2004-10-16 12:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(961655, 112030, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I love the play of shadows.</td>', 'Good idea.  I love the play of shadows.', '2004-10-16 12:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(961656, 112509, 12962, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a good eye for graphic design elements.  The repetition is just gorgeous.</td>', 'You''ve got a good eye for graphic design elements.  The repetition is just gorgeous.', '2004-10-16 12:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(961657, 112313, 27847, '<td valign="top">I don''t like doing this, but I guess its personal opinion! I just didn''t like the picture. I get the communication idea and I think it would have been a good picture if it was toned down a bit and you could have called it something like ''communication breakthrough'', with what it seems like the sun breaking through the clouds! Dont kill the  ;-)<br/>Hopefully I was the only one with this bad opinion, nice picture for a album cover!<br/></td>', 'I don''t like doing this, but I guess its personal opinion! I just didn''t like the picture. I get the communication idea and I think it would have been a good picture if it was toned down a bit and you could have called it something like ''communication breakthrough'', with what it seems like the sun breaking through the clouds! Dont kill the  ;-)Hopefully I was the only one with this bad opinion, nice picture for a album cover!', '2004-10-16 12:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(961659, 112000, 12962, '<td valign="top">:-).</td>', ':-).', '2004-10-16 12:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(961660, 112399, 25143, '<td valign="top">very nive idea</td>', 'very nive idea', '2004-10-16 12:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(961661, 111309, 27847, '<td valign="top">This could have been a really great picture, I think what you are trying to portray is a ''communication overload''. Especially now a day, TOO MUCH TV! It''s everywhere, killing our brain cells one by one. I just didn''t like it because of the focus and lighting, if the remote and the hand was in focus together I think this picture would have more potential. Dont despair, just one opinion. Were all here to learn!</td>', 'This could have been a really great picture, I think what you are trying to portray is a ''communication overload''. Especially now a day, TOO MUCH TV! It''s everywhere, killing our brain cells one by one. I just didn''t like it because of the focus and lighting, if the remote and the hand was in focus together I think this picture would have more potential. Dont despair, just one opinion. Were all here to learn!', '2004-10-16 12:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(961662, 111398, 25143, '<td valign="top">the radio tower is less the theme than the great reflections in the water</td>', 'the radio tower is less the theme than the great reflections in the water', '2004-10-16 12:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(961663, 112431, 12962, '<td valign="top">Among the similar shots, I found this the best because of the nostalgic feel that it evokes and the unpretentiousness of the shot.  Title is very appropriate for the way you took the shot.  10.</td>', 'Among the similar shots, I found this the best because of the nostalgic feel that it evokes and the unpretentiousness of the shot.  Title is very appropriate for the way you took the shot.  10.', '2004-10-16 12:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(961665, 111322, 25143, '<td valign="top">funny but the colors (or rather the lack thereof) do not work too well</td>', 'funny but the colors (or rather the lack thereof) do not work too well', '2004-10-16 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(961666, 112379, 12962, '<td valign="top">Hahahahahaahahah!</td>', 'Hahahahahaahahah!', '2004-10-16 12:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(961669, 112201, 25143, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a bit dull but the idea and image appeal very much</td>', 'the lighting is a bit dull but the idea and image appeal very much', '2004-10-16 12:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(961671, 111542, 12962, '<td valign="top">Great expressions.  Border distracts.</td>', 'Great expressions.  Border distracts.', '2004-10-16 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(961672, 112155, 25143, '<td valign="top">nicely weird - great composition</td>', 'nicely weird - great composition', '2004-10-16 12:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(961675, 112409, 12962, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2004-10-16 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(961693, 112389, 26757, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, I found hand in this image to be poorly composed, with ineffectual lighting, and generally crass.  No too mention an overtly sad commentary on societal acceptance.<br/>ginette</td>', 'In my opinion, I found hand in this image to be poorly composed, with ineffectual lighting, and generally crass.  No too mention an overtly sad commentary on societal acceptance.ginette', '2004-10-16 12:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(961701, 112409, 26757, '<td valign="top">I found this image to be an excellent commentary on where we are headed as a society....  I wonder if it might have been even stronger, were a child have been used as a model rather than an adult male? <br/>His seated body language shows him at ease, and natural... I loved the lighting, and composition, the shadows fell nicely onto his body and face.  The lighting also does a nice job rimming the cell phone/pda.  I alos like the cool appeal of the Van Dyke Blue toning.  Really fantastic stock photo!<br/>ginette</td>', 'I found this image to be an excellent commentary on where we are headed as a society....  I wonder if it might have been even stronger, were a child have been used as a model rather than an adult male? His seated body language shows him at ease, and natural... I loved the lighting, and composition, the shadows fell nicely onto his body and face.  The lighting also does a nice job rimming the cell phone/pda.  I alos like the cool appeal of the Van Dyke Blue toning.  Really fantastic stock photo!ginette', '2004-10-16 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(961709, 112090, 26757, '<td valign="top">Very nice...  I haven''t seen morse code written since I was a little girl, and my DaD wanted me to get my radio operators license...  Brings back memories.<br/>Nicely composed, I would have liked to have seen a bit more drama in the lighting though, so that there was a little more shadow falling onto the printed page, and rimming the envelope.  Still, over all, very nice.<br/>ginette</td>', 'Very nice...  I haven''t seen morse code written since I was a little girl, and my DaD wanted me to get my radio operators license...  Brings back memories.Nicely composed, I would have liked to have seen a bit more drama in the lighting though, so that there was a little more shadow falling onto the printed page, and rimming the envelope.  Still, over all, very nice.ginette', '2004-10-16 13:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(961715, 111205, 26757, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo!  Love the angle of composition, and the overall composition.  Nice detail in the shadows... (though I would love to see a wee more inside the coach window).  Great choice of toning, and highlighting the lettering with yellow was an excellent touch.  Terrific focusing, which gave great texture in the details.  One of my favorites in this challenge!<br/>ginette</td>', 'Wonderful photo!  Love the angle of composition, and the overall composition.  Nice detail in the shadows... (though I would love to see a wee more inside the coach window).  Great choice of toning, and highlighting the lettering with yellow was an excellent touch.  Terrific focusing, which gave great texture in the details.  One of my favorites in this challenge!ginette', '2004-10-16 13:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(961742, 111688, 23913, '<td valign="top">it is an intrusting idea but i feel that the fan is not as much the subject of the shot as the face now (i of corse not speaking fan) if the fan had been spred open and say not  eaven covering any part of the face, i think it would still have more of a presence as the subject in this image.</td>', 'it is an intrusting idea but i feel that the fan is not as much the subject of the shot as the face now (i of corse not speaking fan) if the fan had been spred open and say not  eaven covering any part of the face, i think it would still have more of a presence as the subject in this image.', '2004-10-16 13:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(961745, 111542, 8005, '<td valign="top">Vdery good picture. The look on her face is priceless.</td>', 'Vdery good picture. The look on her face is priceless.', '2004-10-16 13:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(961747, 112320, 23913, '<td valign="top">it is a nice shot but (theres always a but) there are some distracting things about it and those to me sorta reck the photo. 1st-the funny pentagone shaped splaches off to the right<br/>                                             2nd-there are some rinkles in the fabric under the right tub to the         <br/>                                                    ear.<br/>                                             3rdandlast-the overex. on the steth. its self</td>', 'it is a nice shot but (theres always a but) there are some distracting things about it and those to me sorta reck the photo. 1st-the funny pentagone shaped splaches off to the right                                             2nd-there are some rinkles in the fabric under the right tub to the                                                             ear.                                             3rdandlast-the overex. on the steth. its self', '2004-10-16 13:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(961753, 111490, 16488, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of feeling in this photo....the look, the smile.  Unfortunately the out of focus subject make this too much of a snapshot.  Some color adjustment, also, might help balance in yellow glow of the indoor lighing.</td>', 'There''s a lot of feeling in this photo....the look, the smile.  Unfortunately the out of focus subject make this too much of a snapshot.  Some color adjustment, also, might help balance in yellow glow of the indoor lighing.', '2004-10-16 14:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(961755, 112243, 16488, '<td valign="top">Choosing to photograph only a portion of the phone means to me that you''re thinking about your subject.  But it seems that the composition is lacking in interest.  You''ve used shallow depth of field, but it''s not helping to point me to what must have been interesting to you.  There''s also a reddish cast to this....perhaps accentuating the contrast betwen the black phone and it''s surrounding white would give this more graphic impact.</td>', 'Choosing to photograph only a portion of the phone means to me that you''re thinking about your subject.  But it seems that the composition is lacking in interest.  You''ve used shallow depth of field, but it''s not helping to point me to what must have been interesting to you.  There''s also a reddish cast to this....perhaps accentuating the contrast betwen the black phone and it''s surrounding white would give this more graphic impact.', '2004-10-16 14:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(961757, 111478, 16488, '<td valign="top">Removing the phone entirely from context makes it look like an ad picture....it doesn''t seem to say much more to me than "this is a phone."  The low contrast and grainy appearance don''t create mood or tell me more about the subject.  Sorry.  Just the way I see it.</td>', 'Removing the phone entirely from context makes it look like an ad picture....it doesn''t seem to say much more to me than "this is a phone."  The low contrast and grainy appearance don''t create mood or tell me more about the subject.  Sorry.  Just the way I see it.', '2004-10-16 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(961760, 111658, 16488, '<td valign="top">Backlighting on the bleeding hearts is pretty.  The background is, however, distracting.  It competes with your subject and lines of composition.  Perhaps if you had isolated one of the blossoms?  It''s also a liberal interpretation of the challenge...do we really use these to convey ideas between people?</td>', 'Backlighting on the bleeding hearts is pretty.  The background is, however, distracting.  It competes with your subject and lines of composition.  Perhaps if you had isolated one of the blossoms?  It''s also a liberal interpretation of the challenge...do we really use these to convey ideas between people?', '2004-10-16 14:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(961762, 111142, 16488, '<td valign="top">This would have more graphic appeal, to me, if the nearest can was in focus.  The shadows are harsh, a second light source would reduce that and give more modeling to your subject.  Black and white a nice choice for your subject.</td>', 'This would have more graphic appeal, to me, if the nearest can was in focus.  The shadows are harsh, a second light source would reduce that and give more modeling to your subject.  Black and white a nice choice for your subject.', '2004-10-16 14:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(961767, 112004, 16488, '<td valign="top">This has interesting form.  I like the way it floats in the frame.  Lighting and limited depth of fierld lend character.   The title, however, doesn''t fit for me...it seems more like a sad phone than a seductive one.</td>', 'This has interesting form.  I like the way it floats in the frame.  Lighting and limited depth of fierld lend character.   The title, however, doesn''t fit for me...it seems more like a sad phone than a seductive one.', '2004-10-16 14:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(961768, 111846, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot of kids.  But a real stretch for the challenge.  I like the lighting.  Wish the expression on the child in the background was more visible.  Just too much like a crop of a snapshot for my tastes.</td>', 'Sweet shot of kids.  But a real stretch for the challenge.  I like the lighting.  Wish the expression on the child in the background was more visible.  Just too much like a crop of a snapshot for my tastes.', '2004-10-16 14:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(961772, 111590, 16488, '<td valign="top">Unless these crabs are using little semiphore flags that I can''t see.....nevermind.<br/>Seems to me your subjects are out of focus.  Composition could be improved by moving the crabs off center.  Nice tonal range.  Overall, it just doesn''t say much to me.</td>', 'Unless these crabs are using little semiphore flags that I can''t see.....nevermind.Seems to me your subjects are out of focus.  Composition could be improved by moving the crabs off center.  Nice tonal range.  Overall, it just doesn''t say much to me.', '2004-10-16 14:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(961775, 111670, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of cellphone use.  The wide-angle view, lighting and focus, seem to make the person''s nose the subject of this shot, however.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation of cellphone use.  The wide-angle view, lighting and focus, seem to make the person''s nose the subject of this shot, however.', '2004-10-16 14:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(961778, 111319, 16488, '<td valign="top">My first thought was that your subject wasn''t something used to convey ideas between people.  It seems more like a receiver.  Yes, though, it does communicate outside noise to the listener''s brain....so. o.k.  But on the whole the image is unappealing.</td>', 'My first thought was that your subject wasn''t something used to convey ideas between people.  It seems more like a receiver.  Yes, though, it does communicate outside noise to the listener''s brain....so. o.k.  But on the whole the image is unappealing.', '2004-10-16 14:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(961782, 111656, 8054, '<td valign="top">Details of the pole are sharp. Although the leaves are blurred, they almost seem to play the role of main focal point next to the in focus pole. This is because they occupy such a large portion of the frame. Try to maintain focus on the subject you want to emphasize such as the pole and lines.</td>', 'Details of the pole are sharp. Although the leaves are blurred, they almost seem to play the role of main focal point next to the in focus pole. This is because they occupy such a large portion of the frame. Try to maintain focus on the subject you want to emphasize such as the pole and lines.', '2004-10-16 14:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(961783, 111757, 25773, '<td valign="top">I don''t see connection to the communication topic.</td>', 'I don''t see connection to the communication topic.', '2004-10-16 14:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(961784, 112423, 25773, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title: this picture doesn''t show food given to the geese.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title: this picture doesn''t show food given to the geese.', '2004-10-16 14:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(961819, 112182, 16488, '<td valign="top">A picture of a church certainly answers the challenge.  But I''d like to see the top of the steeple, some contrast in the building, intersting light and sky.</td>', 'A picture of a church certainly answers the challenge.  But I''d like to see the top of the steeple, some contrast in the building, intersting light and sky.', '2004-10-16 15:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(961829, 112338, 28055, '<td valign="top">Nice comparision.</td>', 'Nice comparision.', '2004-10-16 16:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
