(961926, 112197, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very unique look.  The posterized style matches well with the background -- it''s like he''s part of the wall.</td>', 'Very unique look.  The posterized style matches well with the background -- it''s like he''s part of the wall.', '2004-10-16 19:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
