(962059, 112443, 22686, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think it would have worked better focussed on the tip rather than the logo. Unless the intent was ironic, re: the communication in advertising in which case again - nice idea, but too subtle.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think it would have worked better focussed on the tip rather than the logo. Unless the intent was ironic, re: the communication in advertising in which case again - nice idea, but too subtle.', '2004-10-16 22:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
