(962071, 112446, 22686, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to "get" this one. Cute. A sort of visual pun.</td>', 'Took me a second to "get" this one. Cute. A sort of visual pun.', '2004-10-16 22:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(962073, 112483, 26756, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a nicely done photo.  You not only caputured the idea of non-verbal communication in touch, but even the position of the hands was well thought out.  Like one person is leading and reassuring the other.  Good job.</td>', 'Great idea and a nicely done photo.  You not only caputured the idea of non-verbal communication in touch, but even the position of the hands was well thought out.  Like one person is leading and reassuring the other.  Good job.', '2004-10-16 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(962080, 112508, 26756, '<td valign="top">This photo has a nice feeling of the 30''s or 40''s to it.  Could be your use of colors..the silver and the red/oranges.</td>', 'This photo has a nice feeling of the 30''s or 40''s to it.  Could be your use of colors..the silver and the red/oranges.', '2004-10-16 22:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(962082, 111962, 27842, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  It really makes you think.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  It really makes you think.', '2004-10-16 22:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(962083, 112380, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very interesting grain</td>', 'Very interesting grain', '2004-10-16 22:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(962085, 112187, 26756, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, they are just amazing.  I like the position of the bottle too.  I''d prefer to see it either as a complete silhouette or with a bit more light to see the message inside, but that''s really getting picky.  Really good job.</td>', 'Love the colors, they are just amazing.  I like the position of the bottle too.  I''d prefer to see it either as a complete silhouette or with a bit more light to see the message inside, but that''s really getting picky.  Really good job.', '2004-10-16 22:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(962090, 111205, 27842, '<td valign="top">NIce post processing effect</td>', 'NIce post processing effect', '2004-10-16 22:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(962146, 111078, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what is being communicated here.  This shot has a very flat appearance and the colors are kinda dull.  Did you use the on camera flash?  If so, try shooting again without it.  Preferably during early morning or late evening hours when the light is best.  Playing with levels in photoshop or other editing software will help bring out the colors also.<br/>Compositionally, the centered subject doesn''t look like it is placed properly.  An off centered compostion would help.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m not sure what is being communicated here.  This shot has a very flat appearance and the colors are kinda dull.  Did you use the on camera flash?  If so, try shooting again without it.  Preferably during early morning or late evening hours when the light is best.  Playing with levels in photoshop or other editing software will help bring out the colors also.Compositionally, the centered subject doesn''t look like it is placed properly.  An off centered compostion would help.TC', '2004-10-16 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(962152, 111542, 9906, '<td valign="top">Excellent expression in the right models face!  Great use of catchlights in her eyes.  You are very overexposed though blowing out a lot of the detail in both the models tops.  If you were shooting for a high key approach, you missed it by a smidge.  I see this in the discolored background.  Compositionally, the negative space to the right appears to off balance the shot.  Cropping with a couple sheets of paper held up to my monitor, cutting off a third of the model on the left (say right behind her ear) and the dead space on the right makes a much cleaner composition with more oomph.<br/>TC</td>', 'Excellent expression in the right models face!  Great use of catchlights in her eyes.  You are very overexposed though blowing out a lot of the detail in both the models tops.  If you were shooting for a high key approach, you missed it by a smidge.  I see this in the discolored background.  Compositionally, the negative space to the right appears to off balance the shot.  Cropping with a couple sheets of paper held up to my monitor, cutting off a third of the model on the left (say right behind her ear) and the dead space on the right makes a much cleaner composition with more oomph.TC', '2004-10-16 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(962154, 112056, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very busy shot with no real subject.  My eye has no place to rest...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very busy shot with no real subject.  My eye has no place to rest...TC', '2004-10-16 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(962158, 111205, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Did you desat all but the yellow here?  It''s the only thing that don''t look right.  There doesn''t seem to be a reason for it.  Also the yellow on the top right corner is kinda distracting/detracting.  If you didn''t desat all but the yellow, this would be a great candidate for a b/w treatment!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice composition.  Did you desat all but the yellow here?  It''s the only thing that don''t look right.  There doesn''t seem to be a reason for it.  Also the yellow on the top right corner is kinda distracting/detracting.  If you didn''t desat all but the yellow, this would be a great candidate for a b/w treatment!TC', '2004-10-17 00:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(962161, 112389, 9906, '<td valign="top">Without making a PC comment of any kind, the background is distracting.  Nicely lit and focused.<br/>TC</td>', 'Without making a PC comment of any kind, the background is distracting.  Nicely lit and focused.TC', '2004-10-17 00:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(962162, 111659, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  My only suggestion would be to soak the can and get the glue off first, or rotate the can so it doesn''t show.  In a set up shot such as this, it''s the little details that take a shot that is good and make it great!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely done.  My only suggestion would be to soak the can and get the glue off first, or rotate the can so it doesn''t show.  In a set up shot such as this, it''s the little details that take a shot that is good and make it great!TC', '2004-10-17 00:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(962164, 111309, 9906, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lack of communication going on in this shot...<br/>TC</td>', 'There seems to be a lack of communication going on in this shot...TC', '2004-10-17 00:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(962167, 112058, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but lacks much for interest.  If it was sharper it might work, but as soft as this is, it just looks busy...<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting composition, but lacks much for interest.  If it was sharper it might work, but as soft as this is, it just looks busy...TC', '2004-10-17 00:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(962168, 111431, 9906, '<td valign="top">Where did you find an old school rig like this?<br/>TC</td>', 'Where did you find an old school rig like this?TC', '2004-10-17 00:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(962169, 112268, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you the challenge theme for this one.  Very cute shot that appears to be exposed nicely given the time of day that it appears to have been shot in.  You also have nice seperation of models and background.  THe only thing I might change is a tighter crop to get rid of some of the grass in foreground and even out the space at the sides of the boys.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''ll give you the challenge theme for this one.  Very cute shot that appears to be exposed nicely given the time of day that it appears to have been shot in.  You also have nice seperation of models and background.  THe only thing I might change is a tighter crop to get rid of some of the grass in foreground and even out the space at the sides of the boys.TC', '2004-10-17 00:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(962170, 111535, 9906, '<td valign="top">What an impossible exposure...  I''m sure you''ve gotten the comments about your blown out background.  A different angle between subjects or better yet, shooting during the golden hours (just after dawn or just before sunset) would do wonders for this...<br/>TC</td>', 'What an impossible exposure...  I''m sure you''ve gotten the comments about your blown out background.  A different angle between subjects or better yet, shooting during the golden hours (just after dawn or just before sunset) would do wonders for this...TC', '2004-10-17 00:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(962178, 112050, 9906, '<td valign="top">Giving you a bump up for cute factor as well as a decent attempt at a tough exposure (slightly overexposed in the left models shirt and almost loose the right models sandles in the grass.)  Nice choice for b/w treatment!<br/>TC</td>', 'Giving you a bump up for cute factor as well as a decent attempt at a tough exposure (slightly overexposed in the left models shirt and almost loose the right models sandles in the grass.)  Nice choice for b/w treatment!TC', '2004-10-17 00:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(962182, 112323, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too bad the ugly scaffolding(?) is there.  Other wise very nice composition and tonality.<br/>TC</td>', 'Too bad the ugly scaffolding(?) is there.  Other wise very nice composition and tonality.TC', '2004-10-17 00:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(962185, 112486, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not terribly interesting and I don''t see the reason for the blue being left in the shot unless you are making a commercial for a corporate conglomaration.  If that was your intent, you should crop out the blue object on the left side down low...<br/>TC</td>', 'Not terribly interesting and I don''t see the reason for the blue being left in the shot unless you are making a commercial for a corporate conglomaration.  If that was your intent, you should crop out the blue object on the left side down low...TC', '2004-10-17 00:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(962186, 112470, 9906, '<td valign="top">THe statue behind the cannon is very distracting in silhouette form (an unneeded element!).  Move a couple steps to your right and this shot would be the bomb!  Any chance for a reshoot?<br/>TC</td>', 'THe statue behind the cannon is very distracting in silhouette form (an unneeded element!).  Move a couple steps to your right and this shot would be the bomb!  Any chance for a reshoot?TC', '2004-10-17 00:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(962187, 112313, 9906, '<td valign="top">I never have and never will appreciate these psychedelic, way overprocessed shots...<br/>TC</td>', 'I never have and never will appreciate these psychedelic, way overprocessed shots...TC', '2004-10-17 00:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(962194, 111680, 9906, '<td valign="top">Ever so slightly too contrasty (lack of definition in the street performers face and pants).  Otherwise this is an awesome example of a b/w treatment.  After the challenge PM me and I''ll try and find the link to a page that shows how to ''finish'' this into an awesome print quality shot!<br/>TC</td>', 'Ever so slightly too contrasty (lack of definition in the street performers face and pants).  Otherwise this is an awesome example of a b/w treatment.  After the challenge PM me and I''ll try and find the link to a page that shows how to ''finish'' this into an awesome print quality shot!TC', '2004-10-17 00:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(962195, 112487, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very oversharpened.  You have sharpening artifacts all around the finger.  Was the DOF out of camera or did you photoshop it in?  It doesn''t look quite right.  Nice composition for a high key type of shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very oversharpened.  You have sharpening artifacts all around the finger.  Was the DOF out of camera or did you photoshop it in?  It doesn''t look quite right.  Nice composition for a high key type of shot.TC', '2004-10-17 00:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
