(962248, 112198, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is so far the first shot to make me stop and say ''Wow''.  Nicely exposed.  Love the fact that yougot 5 of the seven sisters and Orions belt.  Great gradiations of light in the dish itself.  Only thing that detracts is the brighter area in the bottom left.  Easily fixed in advanced editing.  In basic editing, maybe croping that out (I know you lose part of the dish, but it may have made this a top 5 instead of top 20)...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is so far the first shot to make me stop and say ''Wow''.  Nicely exposed.  Love the fact that yougot 5 of the seven sisters and Orions belt.  Great gradiations of light in the dish itself.  Only thing that detracts is the brighter area in the bottom left.  Easily fixed in advanced editing.  In basic editing, maybe croping that out (I know you lose part of the dish, but it may have made this a top 5 instead of top 20)...TC', '2004-10-17 02:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
