(962587, 111843, 4747, '<td valign="top">Great vibrant colors --- I think this shot had oh so much more potential than you allowed it. <br/>You shot pretty much straight on and the image is fairly flat,  a different angle would give greater depth of field. <br/>(Are you opposed to laying on the ground and shooting up?)<br/>Focusing on one dramatic part of the wall and letting the rest of the graffiti frame your center point would give it more impact.</td>', 'Great vibrant colors --- I think this shot had oh so much more potential than you allowed it. You shot pretty much straight on and the image is fairly flat,  a different angle would give greater depth of field. (Are you opposed to laying on the ground and shooting up?)Focusing on one dramatic part of the wall and letting the rest of the graffiti frame your center point would give it more impact.', '2004-10-17 13:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
