(962768, 112409, 22484, '<td valign="top">This concept is very common but the single colour tone is best. Lighting from left is very good. Model is impressive. This photo should be crop from approx. center of rope because there is a spot of the light on the left side is highlighted .. or it should be blur properly. Best photo. 10</td>', 'This concept is very common but the single colour tone is best. Lighting from left is very good. Model is impressive. This photo should be crop from approx. center of rope because there is a spot of the light on the left side is highlighted .. or it should be blur properly. Best photo. 10', '2004-10-17 16:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(962773, 111413, 22484, '<td valign="top">I am not also a good photographer but... my openion is  You must not submit the simple concept like this. Photographic effect must look in our photo. Don''t mind.<br/>I also did same mistake in my previous submission.</td>', 'I am not also a good photographer but... my openion is  You must not submit the simple concept like this. Photographic effect must look in our photo. Don''t mind.I also did same mistake in my previous submission.', '2004-10-17 16:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
