(965006, 112198, 27767, '<td valign="top">Oooo, very cool.  I like this a lot.  I think the composition is great, and the long exposure to get the stars makes a huge statement.  The colors are very nice, and the darkening from bottom left to top right gives a good balance. Impactful.</td>', 'Oooo, very cool.  I like this a lot.  I think the composition is great, and the long exposure to get the stars makes a huge statement.  The colors are very nice, and the darkening from bottom left to top right gives a good balance. Impactful.', '2004-10-19 08:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(965010, 112170, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Maybe cropping out more of the overexposed sky could give more attention to your message.  Cool reflection on the water too.</td>', 'Good idea.  Maybe cropping out more of the overexposed sky could give more attention to your message.  Cool reflection on the water too.', '2004-10-19 08:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
