(965020, 112514, 27767, '<td valign="top">Popular idea that has a clear message.  This shot looks pretty "noisy" evenly through out the image.  The positioning of the two heads in the dead center of the photo detracts from the life of the shot a little. Maybe using a close up shot with shallow depth of field, and composing the position of the right-hand side girl''s eye by using the rule of thirds would give some extra punch to the picture.</td>', 'Popular idea that has a clear message.  This shot looks pretty "noisy" evenly through out the image.  The positioning of the two heads in the dead center of the photo detracts from the life of the shot a little. Maybe using a close up shot with shallow depth of field, and composing the position of the right-hand side girl''s eye by using the rule of thirds would give some extra punch to the picture.', '2004-10-19 08:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
