(965761, 112321, 23680, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better if the flag was not in the shot, my eyes are drawn to it instead of the focus of the picture.</td>', 'I would have liked this better if the flag was not in the shot, my eyes are drawn to it instead of the focus of the picture.', '2004-10-19 22:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(965762, 111655, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting. That tag on the stethoscope is kinda glaring. Honestly, I wouldn''t have thought of this as communication in the traditional sense, but there''s more than one stethoscope shot, so I''m curious to see how you finish. Good luck, Kris!</td>', 'Good composition and lighting. That tag on the stethoscope is kinda glaring. Honestly, I wouldn''t have thought of this as communication in the traditional sense, but there''s more than one stethoscope shot, so I''m curious to see how you finish. Good luck, Kris!', '2004-10-19 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(965767, 112272, 17203, '<td valign="top">LOL... can you hear me NOW?! Interesting idea. The OOF knife handle is OK, since it leads your eye to the "feature." The only thing that bugs me is that you''ve got a horizontally centered composition that isn''t. I might have centered it more, turned it diagonally or moved it even more off-center so it looks intentional.</td>', 'LOL... can you hear me NOW?! Interesting idea. The OOF knife handle is OK, since it leads your eye to the "feature." The only thing that bugs me is that you''ve got a horizontally centered composition that isn''t. I might have centered it more, turned it diagonally or moved it even more off-center so it looks intentional.', '2004-10-19 22:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(965769, 112267, 27416, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture nice play on words</td>', 'I really like this picture nice play on words', '2004-10-19 22:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(965770, 112387, 23680, '<td valign="top">Funny :)</td>', 'Funny :)', '2004-10-19 22:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(965772, 111699, 17203, '<td valign="top">"Sorry I mist your call..."  ;-)<br/>A surreal landscape you found there. One minor irritation is the distortion that you could have easily corrected. Still a very good entry. 8</td>', '"Sorry I mist your call..."  ;-)A surreal landscape you found there. One minor irritation is the distortion that you could have easily corrected. Still a very good entry. 8', '2004-10-19 22:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(965773, 112000, 27416, '<td valign="top">very nice shot</td>', 'very nice shot', '2004-10-19 22:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(965774, 111604, 23680, '<td valign="top">One of my top shots for this challenge - good job</td>', 'One of my top shots for this challenge - good job', '2004-10-19 22:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(965776, 112509, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the composition, the sepia tones, very futuristic looking 9</td>', 'Very nice, I like the composition, the sepia tones, very futuristic looking 9', '2004-10-19 22:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
