(965816, 110697, 23680, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot, are they wax people?  I looked long and hard at this one and that''s what they look like to me :)</td>', 'This is a very cool shot, are they wax people?  I looked long and hard at this one and that''s what they look like to me :)', '2004-10-19 22:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(965823, 111590, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... what we seem to have here is a failure to communicate. Interesting as far as the sandballs go, but I''m afraid I don''t get it communication-wise..</td>', 'Hmm... what we seem to have here is a failure to communicate. Interesting as far as the sandballs go, but I''m afraid I don''t get it communication-wise..', '2004-10-19 22:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(965827, 111559, 17203, '<td valign="top">Are those cans touchtone or rotary? I know there''s a bunch of similar shots, but I think it would add a lot to show people actually communicating rather than just the device itself.</td>', 'Are those cans touchtone or rotary? I know there''s a bunch of similar shots, but I think it would add a lot to show people actually communicating rather than just the device itself.', '2004-10-19 22:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(965831, 112508, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice. A unique idea as far as I''ve seen. A couple of nitpicks... The composition is disturbingly tight, though presumably intentional. I''d like to see some edge to the reflections on the right side (or no reflections at all). They seem to be floating in space.</td>', 'Nice. A unique idea as far as I''ve seen. A couple of nitpicks... The composition is disturbingly tight, though presumably intentional. I''d like to see some edge to the reflections on the right side (or no reflections at all). They seem to be floating in space.', '2004-10-19 22:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(965833, 111222, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great idea, not as great execution. You could have created a sort of evolutionary line (maybe even as silhouettes), but the uneven spacing and fading focus hurt this shot IMHO.</td>', 'Great idea, not as great execution. You could have created a sort of evolutionary line (maybe even as silhouettes), but the uneven spacing and fading focus hurt this shot IMHO.', '2004-10-19 22:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(965835, 111371, 17203, '<td valign="top">Um... I don''t get it. Not even a road sign to suggest communication?</td>', 'Um... I don''t get it. Not even a road sign to suggest communication?', '2004-10-19 22:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(965836, 112520, 17203, '<td valign="top">Brilliant (pun intended) approach to the challenge. I''d have flipped the image to put the "punch line" at the end, so to speak, but that''s just me. 8</td>', 'Brilliant (pun intended) approach to the challenge. I''d have flipped the image to put the "punch line" at the end, so to speak, but that''s just me. 8', '2004-10-19 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(965837, 112165, 28209, '<td valign="top">Wonderful black and white photo, I can feel his weariness!</td>', 'Wonderful black and white photo, I can feel his weariness!', '2004-10-19 22:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(965840, 112501, 28209, '<td valign="top">Makes me wonder, where are the owners of the glasses? Where did they sneak off to? Great photo!</td>', 'Makes me wonder, where are the owners of the glasses? Where did they sneak off to? Great photo!', '2004-10-19 22:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(965843, 112297, 17203, '<td valign="top">With this DOF, the focus is on the starlings rather than the communication equipment. It would help if one or more of the birds had its beak open.</td>', 'With this DOF, the focus is on the starlings rather than the communication equipment. It would help if one or more of the birds had its beak open.', '2004-10-19 23:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(965844, 111490, 28209, '<td valign="top">Very loving photo. You can feel the warmth of their love for each other. marvelous picture! I''d love a copy!</td>', 'Very loving photo. You can feel the warmth of their love for each other. marvelous picture! I''d love a copy!', '2004-10-19 23:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(965845, 110883, 17203, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept and execution. Good job isolating the arms in Basic Editing. The light seems a little flat, but still worth a 9.</td>', 'Excellent concept and execution. Good job isolating the arms in Basic Editing. The light seems a little flat, but still worth a 9.', '2004-10-19 23:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(965848, 112409, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yessiree... those <i>wireless</i> cans are all the rage these days. Nice one, Yanik.</td>', 'Yessiree... those wireless cans are all the rage these days. Nice one, Yanik.', '2004-10-19 23:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(965852, 112239, 17203, '<td valign="top">A great idea, partly ruined by the blown out sun. Shooting in RAW might have helped if it was an option. A little detail that would have been nice is bare footprints rather than shoes to help that ''castaway'' theme.</td>', 'A great idea, partly ruined by the blown out sun. Shooting in RAW might have helped if it was an option. A little detail that would have been nice is bare footprints rather than shoes to help that ''castaway'' theme.', '2004-10-19 23:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
