(965934, 111492, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very cool. A unique subject in this tin can challenge, with great perspective and color. The angle and DOF make the shot very dynamic. One of my top picks. 9</td>', 'Very cool. A unique subject in this tin can challenge, with great perspective and color. The angle and DOF make the shot very dynamic. One of my top picks. 9', '2004-10-20 00:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(965935, 112170, 15242, '<td valign="top">Crop it off just above the sign to get rid of the unimpressive sky and the shot is 2 points better.</td>', 'Crop it off just above the sign to get rid of the unimpressive sky and the shot is 2 points better.', '2004-10-20 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(965942, 112362, 28005, '<td valign="top">I like how all the snail details tie the photograph together, the colors are lovely, and I especially like that you took care to write an actual letter since the text is readable.  My only nitpick would be that both the envelope and letter were printed on a computer...so why is there a pen lying there?  The pen is an important visual signal for the viewers, since it enforces the idea of a letter in progress, so the change I would suggest would be for the signature to be done in pen instead of being printed like the rest of the letter.</td>', 'I like how all the snail details tie the photograph together, the colors are lovely, and I especially like that you took care to write an actual letter since the text is readable.  My only nitpick would be that both the envelope and letter were printed on a computer...so why is there a pen lying there?  The pen is an important visual signal for the viewers, since it enforces the idea of a letter in progress, so the change I would suggest would be for the signature to be done in pen instead of being printed like the rest of the letter.', '2004-10-20 00:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(965943, 111604, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of my favorite of the challenge.  I wonder what it would look like B&amp;W?</td>', 'Great shot, one of my favorite of the challenge.  I wonder what it would look like B&W?', '2004-10-20 00:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
