(966002, 112198, 20375, '<td valign="top">Wow! My first blue ribbon! This is awesome.<br/>This was a last minute idea, spotted some dish antenna''s at a transmission station, went over to take some shots. <br/>This was just a 30sec exposure on a very clear night...lot''s of stars.<br/>I''m shocked.<br/>Thankyou all for your votes and comments.</td>', 'Wow! My first blue ribbon! This is awesome.This was a last minute idea, spotted some dish antenna''s at a transmission station, went over to take some shots. This was just a 30sec exposure on a very clear night...lot''s of stars.I''m shocked.Thankyou all for your votes and comments.', '2004-10-20 01:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
