(966056, 112183, 27244, '<td valign="top">This is my post to those of which stated that these are not phonelines but are actually powerlines:  You are 1/2 correct, here in rural Illinois the power and phone lines are on the same pole!  If you looked closer at the image you would have seen that there are 4 powerlines and then lower on the pole is a crossbar... that holds the phonelines.  Cropping the top of the first pole off, above the phonelines would have created an off-balance appearance to the rest of the photo.  I did expect an avg. score on this image and challenge (as it is my first) and that is what I got.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all who made helpful comments, it at least lets me learn what to fix and how to take a better photograph.</td>', 'This is my post to those of which stated that these are not phonelines but are actually powerlines:  You are 1/2 correct, here in rural Illinois the power and phone lines are on the same pole!  If you looked closer at the image you would have seen that there are 4 powerlines and then lower on the pole is a crossbar... that holds the phonelines.  Cropping the top of the first pole off, above the phonelines would have created an off-balance appearance to the rest of the photo.  I did expect an avg. score on this image and challenge (as it is my first) and that is what I got. Thanks to all who made helpful comments, it at least lets me learn what to fix and how to take a better photograph.', '2004-10-20 01:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(966057, 112468, 26472, '<td valign="top">Yea, yea, yea! Congrats on your first ribbon! Whoo hoo!!!!</td>', 'Yea, yea, yea! Congrats on your first ribbon! Whoo hoo!!!!', '2004-10-20 01:32:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(966059, 111492, 14202, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on Yellow...Well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-20 00:32:36.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on Yellow...Well done.', '2004-10-20 01:32:15.000000', '2004-10-20 01:32:36.000000', 0),
(966069, 112389, 18748, '<td valign="top">Could"t vote,had few test to study, but your image is good and would not score less then 8 from me.  This is great example of modern sign communication between  different sex and age groups.</td>', 'Could"t vote,had few test to study, but your image is good and would not score less then 8 from me.  This is great example of modern sign communication between  different sex and age groups.', '2004-10-20 01:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(966071, 111870, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot--love the panoramic view here which to me makes a statement about the volume of communication.  I really thought this would win or at least be top 10--your placement is much too low.  And from some of the lower scores, I can only assume people REALLY REALLY interpreted this challenge very shallowly.  <br/> <br/>This was the most intelligent take on the challenge shot in the entire set (well, maybe except for mine ;-) which was a political/religious statement)</td>', 'This is a great shot--love the panoramic view here which to me makes a statement about the volume of communication.  I really thought this would win or at least be top 10--your placement is much too low.  And from some of the lower scores, I can only assume people REALLY REALLY interpreted this challenge very shallowly.   This was the most intelligent take on the challenge shot in the entire set (well, maybe except for mine ;-) which was a political/religious statement)', '2004-10-20 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
