(966099, 112470, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I find it amusing that I didn''t recognize this shot since I was standing right there with you. I''ll admit I had a hard time making the connection with communication. You''ve essentially got three subjects here, and the two in the foreground are stronger than the church. You might have had a better connection by shooting from below the cannon to separate the church and obscure the soldier.<br/> <br/>FWIW, I gave this shot a 6.</td>', 'Hmm... I find it amusing that I didn''t recognize this shot since I was standing right there with you. I''ll admit I had a hard time making the connection with communication. You''ve essentially got three subjects here, and the two in the foreground are stronger than the church. You might have had a better connection by shooting from below the cannon to separate the church and obscure the soldier. FWIW, I gave this shot a 6.', '2004-10-20 01:43:36.000000', NULL, 0),
