(966102, 112508, 20210, '<td valign="top">I thought for a few minutes there that I might make top 10. :)  I appreciate all the great comments this round out.  I really enjoy the DPC process.  No matter where I place, it''s a rewarding experience.  Thanks for everyone''s support.</td>', 'I thought for a few minutes there that I might make top 10. :)  I appreciate all the great comments this round out.  I really enjoy the DPC process.  No matter where I place, it''s a rewarding experience.  Thanks for everyone''s support.', '2004-10-20 01:44:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(966106, 111309, 93, '<td valign="top">You know, if you didn''t find my comment helpful, then I can''t even begin to understand what exactly you were looking for..  Moose101 didn''t say much different than I did, and some of the other people who commented were pretty helpful as well.  <br/> <br/>So, sorry I wasn''t helpful, but at least I tried to be.  This is one of the main reasons commenting is dropping off on this site.. poor sportsmanship from the people getting the comments, causing the commenters to just give up on it.</td>', 'You know, if you didn''t find my comment helpful, then I can''t even begin to understand what exactly you were looking for..  Moose101 didn''t say much different than I did, and some of the other people who commented were pretty helpful as well.   So, sorry I wasn''t helpful, but at least I tried to be.  This is one of the main reasons commenting is dropping off on this site.. poor sportsmanship from the people getting the comments, causing the commenters to just give up on it.', '2004-10-20 01:47:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(966130, 112062, 70, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do a middle finger shot for this challenge but I didn''t and seeing yours, I''m glad. Doing it out the car window is so much better. I love the coloring and focus in this shot. Great job.</td>', 'I wanted to do a middle finger shot for this challenge but I didn''t and seeing yours, I''m glad. Doing it out the car window is so much better. I love the coloring and focus in this shot. Great job.', '2004-10-20 01:56:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(966137, 111846, 18799, '<td valign="top">The photo isn''t that good technically, but I got the humor and gave it a 7 because it made me chuckle.  In the end, isn''t that how we should judge our photos... the impact they have?</td>', 'The photo isn''t that good technically, but I got the humor and gave it a 7 because it made me chuckle.  In the end, isn''t that how we should judge our photos... the impact they have?', '2004-10-20 02:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(966177, 111004, 12253, '<td valign="top">Overall, this is a well done shot, and I think photography was a good way to meet the challenge.  I feel two things held this back: 1) the little stuffed animal doesnt belong as part of the message, and 2) the photos were portraits rather than photojournalistic (which to me really puts the communication in photography).<br/> <br/>Sorry I didn''t have time to comment during the challenge.</td>', 'Overall, this is a well done shot, and I think photography was a good way to meet the challenge.  I feel two things held this back: 1) the little stuffed animal doesnt belong as part of the message, and 2) the photos were portraits rather than photojournalistic (which to me really puts the communication in photography). Sorry I didn''t have time to comment during the challenge.', '2004-10-20 02:14:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(966184, 112062, 12896, '<td valign="top">lol that is just great!</td>', 'lol that is just great!', '2004-10-20 02:17:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(966199, 112468, 23203, '<td valign="top">Congratulations once again.. love the photograph<br/>(adding it to my favorites now)<br/></td>', 'Congratulations once again.. love the photograph(adding it to my favorites now)', '2004-10-20 02:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(966264, 112389, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like it :) Meets the challenge head on!</td>', 'I like it :) Meets the challenge head on!', '2004-10-20 02:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(966266, 111991, 16301, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 5th place!</td>', 'Congrats on 5th place!', '2004-10-20 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(966269, 112468, 20375, '<td valign="top">Dana:<br/>Congrats on your second place finish/ribbon!<br/>Wonderful capture...has a real "feel" to it. You have every right<br/>to be proud of the work you put into this shot.<br/>Again...congrats...well done!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Randy.</td>', 'Dana:Congrats on your second place finish/ribbon!Wonderful capture...has a real "feel" to it. You have every rightto be proud of the work you put into this shot.Again...congrats...well done! Regards,Randy.', '2004-10-20 02:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(966274, 111492, 20375, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites in this challenge by one of my favourite <br/>photographers. Congrats!<br/>Excellent angle/perspective. You''ve made the ordinary look so<br/>wonderful!<br/>Well done.<br/>Regards,<br/>Randy</td>', 'One of my favourites in this challenge by one of my favourite photographers. Congrats!Excellent angle/perspective. You''ve made the ordinary look sowonderful!Well done.Regards,Randy', '2004-10-20 02:57:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(966277, 112062, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very simple at connecting with the viewer, one of my few 10''s in the challenge...</td>', 'Very simple at connecting with the viewer, one of my few 10''s in the challenge...', '2004-10-20 02:58:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(966280, 112409, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one Yanik! How long have you had the goatie there, it''s new huh?</td>', 'Good one Yanik! How long have you had the goatie there, it''s new huh?', '2004-10-20 02:59:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(966283, 111808, 20375, '<td valign="top">Keith:<br/>Congrats on your "green ribbon". Watching your scores improve steadily<br/>since you''ve joined. I have no doubt there will  be many more top ten finishes and ribbon winners for you in the future.<br/>Well done job here. Good interpretation of the challenge and exellent photo!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Randy.</td>', 'Keith:Congrats on your "green ribbon". Watching your scores improve steadilysince you''ve joined. I have no doubt there will  be many more top ten finishes and ribbon winners for you in the future.Well done job here. Good interpretation of the challenge and exellent photo! Regards,Randy.', '2004-10-20 02:59:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(966285, 112197, 16301, '<td valign="top">Very very cool shot man! I love the busyiness of the scene and how everything, including you, blends together. The tone and oversharpening are excellent and fit the texture of the wall. Who cares about the score?! +fav<br/> <br/>Keep them coming man...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-20 03:59:09.</i></td>', 'Very very cool shot man! I love the busyiness of the scene and how everything, including you, blends together. The tone and oversharpening are excellent and fit the texture of the wall. Who cares about the score?! +fav Keep them coming man...', '2004-10-20 03:00:05.000000', '2004-10-20 04:59:09.000000', 0),
(966287, 112468, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Wonderful photo, congrats on the ribbon!', '2004-10-20 03:00:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(966289, 111991, 20375, '<td valign="top">Matt:<br/>Congrats on your top ten finish!<br/>I was expecting a Morse Code thingy to be in this challenge...but I wasn''t expecting this! Excellent job!<br/>You''ve done well on this capture.... well deserved top ten finish!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Randy.</td>', 'Matt:Congrats on your top ten finish!I was expecting a Morse Code thingy to be in this challenge...but I wasn''t expecting this! Excellent job!You''ve done well on this capture.... well deserved top ten finish! Regards,Randy.', '2004-10-20 03:01:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(966291, 112468, 23913, '<td valign="top">great job way to go on Red!</td>', 'great job way to go on Red!', '2004-10-20 03:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(966292, 112445, 16301, '<td valign="top">LOL another phone pole?! I liked the mood/look of this photo, it definitely deserves a higher score...</td>', 'LOL another phone pole?! I liked the mood/look of this photo, it definitely deserves a higher score...', '2004-10-20 03:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(966296, 111849, 20375, '<td valign="top">Dove:<br/>Congrats on your top ten finish!<br/>Out of the "message in a bottle" entries...this stood out by such a large margin in my mind.<br/>Excellent interpretation. Your image is wonderful. Focus, perspective, exposure...all combine for a well deserved top ten finish.<br/>Again congrats....I''m sure more top ten finishes and ribbons lie in the future for you!!!!<br/>Regards,<br/>Randy.</td>', 'Dove:Congrats on your top ten finish!Out of the "message in a bottle" entries...this stood out by such a large margin in my mind.Excellent interpretation. Your image is wonderful. Focus, perspective, exposure...all combine for a well deserved top ten finish.Again congrats....I''m sure more top ten finishes and ribbons lie in the future for you!!!!Regards,Randy.', '2004-10-20 03:04:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(966299, 112198, 9389, '<td valign="top">I was the other photographer with dishes, though yours is definitely superior.  I will go through life telling myself I would have ranked higher had you not been here for comparison.<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s a great shot.  Congratulations.</td>', 'I was the other photographer with dishes, though yours is definitely superior.  I will go through life telling myself I would have ranked higher had you not been here for comparison. Anyway, it''s a great shot.  Congratulations.', '2004-10-20 03:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(966301, 112255, 20375, '<td valign="top">Lol....very funny..regarding drinking a bottle of wine!<br/>Congrats on your top ten.<br/>Well exposed shot, original presentation.<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Randy.</td>', 'Lol....very funny..regarding drinking a bottle of wine!Congrats on your top ten.Well exposed shot, original presentation. Regards,Randy.', '2004-10-20 03:06:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(966304, 112198, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the well deserved win!</td>', 'Congrats on the well deserved win!', '2004-10-20 03:07:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(966308, 110883, 20375, '<td valign="top">Heather:<br/>You''ve done well here! I expected this shot to finish slightly higher than it did...nonetheless...congrats on your top ten finish...and only your second entry!<br/>Keep at it...you''ve got the eye/touch ...I can see it.<br/>Well done, well deserved finish.<br/>Regards,<br/>Randy</td>', 'Heather:You''ve done well here! I expected this shot to finish slightly higher than it did...nonetheless...congrats on your top ten finish...and only your second entry!Keep at it...you''ve got the eye/touch ...I can see it.Well done, well deserved finish.Regards,Randy', '2004-10-20 03:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(966311, 111542, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great work here. By far your best image and you are certainly moving in the right direction. My warm congratulations on your top 20 finish. To get an even higher score avoid borders. I like them, but there is shool everywhere that hate them on principle. Regardless, rejoyce. Good job.</td>', 'Great work here. By far your best image and you are certainly moving in the right direction. My warm congratulations on your top 20 finish. To get an even higher score avoid borders. I like them, but there is shool everywhere that hate them on principle. Regardless, rejoyce. Good job.', '2004-10-20 03:09:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(966312, 111492, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, my head keeps tipping to the right when I look at this :))) Congrats on the ribbon, isn''t it time you got a blue one now?</td>', 'Interesting perspective, my head keeps tipping to the right when I look at this :))) Congrats on the ribbon, isn''t it time you got a blue one now?', '2004-10-20 03:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(966314, 112062, 20375, '<td valign="top">Wow. Well done!<br/>Congrats on your top ten finish!<br/>Very simple, effective presentation!<br/>Haven''t we all been there! I like the honesty of this shot...it works.<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Randy</td>', 'Wow. Well done!Congrats on your top ten finish!Very simple, effective presentation!Haven''t we all been there! I like the honesty of this shot...it works. Regards,Randy', '2004-10-20 03:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(966319, 111205, 20375, '<td valign="top">Gringo:<br/>Congrats on the top ten finish!<br/>This one of my picks for top three actually.<br/>I love the shot, challenge appropriate, excellent exposure, good angle/perspective.<br/> <br/>Well done indeed.<br/>Regards,<br/>Randy.</td>', 'Gringo:Congrats on the top ten finish!This one of my picks for top three actually.I love the shot, challenge appropriate, excellent exposure, good angle/perspective. Well done indeed.Regards,Randy.', '2004-10-20 03:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(966335, 112198, 27524, '<td valign="top">Congrats...it was one of best by idea and quality.</td>', 'Congrats...it was one of best by idea and quality.', '2004-10-20 03:36:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(966342, 112468, 11078, '<td valign="top">Congrats Dana <br/>I thought about doing an image like this but didnt have the equipment to set it up<br/>This is how I imagined it but you have done it so much better <br/>Nice work and a derserved ribbon</td>', 'Congrats Dana I thought about doing an image like this but didnt have the equipment to set it upThis is how I imagined it but you have done it so much better Nice work and a derserved ribbon', '2004-10-20 04:00:07.000000', NULL, 0),
