(966348, 112239, 25224, '<td valign="top">good job, I like the color and the concept.  Waves are tough.  Good work.</td>', 'good job, I like the color and the concept.  Waves are tough.  Good work.', '2004-10-20 04:11:51.000000', NULL, 0),
