(966558, 112313, 23729, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for your comments pro and con.  For those who asked, I achieved this effect by using extreme curves adjustments.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for your comments pro and con.  For those who asked, I achieved this effect by using extreme curves adjustments.', '2004-10-20 09:02:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(966575, 112062, 24925, '<td valign="top">This was one of my few 9''s...great photo!  Assuming it was a setup, I would have loved to have been there to see the other driver''s expressions as your ''model'' gave the Trudeau salute until you could get your photos taken!</td>', 'This was one of my few 9''s...great photo!  Assuming it was a setup, I would have loved to have been there to see the other driver''s expressions as your ''model'' gave the Trudeau salute until you could get your photos taken!', '2004-10-20 09:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(966581, 111655, 9821, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scalvert:</b></div><hr/><i> My wife said, "How do you know that''s Hopper?" Well, you got me! Welcome to the agonizing world of challenge scores. You''re probably just a better model than Kris. ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Better model than me?!?! It took me 31 years to grow all that hair on my chest. I''m a natural (thankfully, my gut was cropped out).<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'Originally posted by scalvert: My wife said, "How do you know that''s Hopper?" Well, you got me! Welcome to the agonizing world of challenge scores. You''re probably just a better model than Kris. ;-)   Better model than me?!?! It took me 31 years to grow all that hair on my chest. I''m a natural (thankfully, my gut was cropped out). :)', '2004-10-20 09:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(966582, 111140, 25330, '<td valign="top">Thanks, all, for the comments.  I''m quite pleased with the score, given the politically incorrect nature of the shot which I''m sure put some people off.<br/> <br/>I think most people got the point of the gun barrel being the focal point.  People who have had the experience of being at gunpoint frequently say the black hole of the barrel looked quite big.  Unfortunately I had to have way too much light on the subject to get the DOF where I wanted it.<br/> <br/>My toungue''s not out, by the way.  It just looks that way with the mouth open in a primal scream.<br/> <br/>I ruined my voice and shot $1500 worth of cameras trying to get this.  Perhaps I should have unloaded the pistol first.</td>', 'Thanks, all, for the comments.  I''m quite pleased with the score, given the politically incorrect nature of the shot which I''m sure put some people off. I think most people got the point of the gun barrel being the focal point.  People who have had the experience of being at gunpoint frequently say the black hole of the barrel looked quite big.  Unfortunately I had to have way too much light on the subject to get the DOF where I wanted it. My toungue''s not out, by the way.  It just looks that way with the mouth open in a primal scream. I ruined my voice and shot $1500 worth of cameras trying to get this.  Perhaps I should have unloaded the pistol first.', '2004-10-20 09:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
