(966699, 112062, 18028, '<td valign="top">Well everyone...I wish I could say this was a candid..but it wasn''t... let me introduce you to my GF !<br/> <br/>we did block traffic for 30seconds!  does that count as candid?!  and we also had to explain to our neighbors that we we not in a fight or that the gesture was not directed at them!<br/> <br/>Many many thanx for all the comments and the kind words...it''s a great feeling.</td>', 'Well everyone...I wish I could say this was a candid..but it wasn''t... let me introduce you to my GF ! we did block traffic for 30seconds!  does that count as candid?!  and we also had to explain to our neighbors that we we not in a fight or that the gesture was not directed at them! Many many thanx for all the comments and the kind words...it''s a great feeling.', '2004-10-20 11:01:34.000000', NULL, 0),
