(968160, 112139, 24642, '<td valign="top">This one should have ranked much higher IMO, it got a 10 from me.  Still a good score for your first challenge.  After looking at the shot again I see a possibility for improvement in the composition by having some space (sky) between the can and the arm to make the separation stand out and the focus on the connection which is the cord.  <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work, I am looking forward to see your next entries.</td>', 'This one should have ranked much higher IMO, it got a 10 from me.  Still a good score for your first challenge.  After looking at the shot again I see a possibility for improvement in the composition by having some space (sky) between the can and the arm to make the separation stand out and the focus on the connection which is the cord.   Keep up the good work, I am looking forward to see your next entries.', '2004-10-21 08:09:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(968252, 112139, 27763, '<td valign="top">Thanks, arngrimur. Those are great suggestions for improving the composition. I also considered having her stand farther back, so that she appeared smaller in the frame, in order to emphasize the sense of separation, but for some reason I ended up going with this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-21 08:59:44.</i></td>', 'Thanks, arngrimur. Those are great suggestions for improving the composition. I also considered having her stand farther back, so that she appeared smaller in the frame, in order to emphasize the sense of separation, but for some reason I ended up going with this one.', '2004-10-21 09:57:58.000000', '2004-10-21 09:59:44.000000', 0),
