(970812, 112190, 1031, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the great comments, especially the ones about the sunlight on the shirt -- I really liked the way that came out. I would have cloned out the little spot (a crow, I think) but this was a Basic rules challenge.<br/> <br/>I also left a lot of foreground grass to try and give the impression of a high hill, even though it''s just about a 10-foot rise. For comparison, here''s a square crop of the same photo.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=114850" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/114850.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/114850.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/114850.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thanks for the great comments, especially the ones about the sunlight on the shirt -- I really liked the way that came out. I would have cloned out the little spot (a crow, I think) but this was a Basic rules challenge. I also left a lot of foreground grass to try and give the impression of a high hill, even though it''s just about a 10-foot rise. For comparison, here''s a square crop of the same photo. ', '2004-10-23 14:28:21.000000', NULL, 0),
