(972549, 112317, 24990, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy picture, but this adds to it, the lines are good, nice strong use of colours.  Looking at the size of the Jpeg, you have compressed it a lot, this has led to the sky and surrounding areas touching the poles looking just a little false and pixleated.  If you can try to use all of the available 150Kb which you can upload, you will be left with a much clearer and sharper image. I like this image, and a good crop/angle on something as simpe as a tower.<br/>*Critque Club*<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-25 12:54:01.</i></td>', 'This is a very busy picture, but this adds to it, the lines are good, nice strong use of colours.  Looking at the size of the Jpeg, you have compressed it a lot, this has led to the sky and surrounding areas touching the poles looking just a little false and pixleated.  If you can try to use all of the available 150Kb which you can upload, you will be left with a much clearer and sharper image. I like this image, and a good crop/angle on something as simpe as a tower.*Critque Club*', '2004-10-25 04:17:21.000000', '2004-10-25 13:54:01.000000', 0),
(972567, 112251, 26849, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.<br/> <br/>I covered part of the title to focus the attention on the concept of a book used to pass on legends.<br/> <br/>Cropped tight to not show poor parts of book. But I see your point, that may explain part of the low rating.<br/> <br/>Manicure - guilty as charged.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I covered part of the title to focus the attention on the concept of a book used to pass on legends. Cropped tight to not show poor parts of book. But I see your point, that may explain part of the low rating. Manicure - guilty as charged.', '2004-10-25 04:42:51.000000', NULL, 0),
