(979296, 111870, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments! Sorry to take so long in responding...schoolwork, and lots of it! ;)<br/> <br/>My professor really rocks for modelling for me...and NO, he never writes this much on the board! For Whitman week we sat outside on the grass and talked! THAT is learning...blackboard stuff is...is...naptime! :)<br/> <br/>Thanks again, really really appreciate all of you!<br/> <br/>And Nshapiro, I''m totally flattered. Thank you :)<br/> <br/></td>', ' Thanks for all the comments! Sorry to take so long in responding...schoolwork, and lots of it! ;) My professor really rocks for modelling for me...and NO, he never writes this much on the board! For Whitman week we sat outside on the grass and talked! THAT is learning...blackboard stuff is...is...naptime! :) Thanks again, really really appreciate all of you! And Nshapiro, I''m totally flattered. Thank you :) ', '2004-10-29 14:04:13.000000', NULL, 0),
