(1481864, 112272, 16488, '<td valign="top">Ahh, a perfect 5!<br/> <br/>I thought so, too.  But that''s because, despite your rendition of a cell phone, I hate photos of cell phones and will never rate them higher.  (For some people it''s babies, cats, and other things I like.  For me, it''s cell phones.)<br/> <br/>I suspect you won''t want my technical comments after that, so I''ll just say "Thank you for playing closest to 5 today!</td>', 'Ahh, a perfect 5! I thought so, too.  But that''s because, despite your rendition of a cell phone, I hate photos of cell phones and will never rate them higher.  (For some people it''s babies, cats, and other things I like.  For me, it''s cell phones.) I suspect you won''t want my technical comments after that, so I''ll just say "Thank you for playing closest to 5 today!', '2005-06-24 18:59:04.000000', NULL, 0),
