(3071243, 112380, 30861, '<td valign="top">You know, it''s unbelievable how anal the voters are sometimes, especially about noise. This image just leapt out of the thumbnails at me, and I wasn''t disappointed when I opened it up. The composition is complex and memorable. The disappearing birds-in-flight, so precisely limited to the left edge, are fantastic in how they foreshadow/echo at the same time the birds at rest.<br/> <br/>And this lovely thing couldn''t even score a 5? Even if you ACCEPT that the noise is a flaw, surely the value of the rest of it is manifest and it deserves a 6''ish score? Sigh...</td>', 'You know, it''s unbelievable how anal the voters are sometimes, especially about noise. This image just leapt out of the thumbnails at me, and I wasn''t disappointed when I opened it up. The composition is complex and memorable. The disappearing birds-in-flight, so precisely limited to the left edge, are fantastic in how they foreshadow/echo at the same time the birds at rest. And this lovely thing couldn''t even score a 5? Even if you ACCEPT that the noise is a flaw, surely the value of the rest of it is manifest and it deserves a 6''ish score? Sigh...', '2006-11-29 09:18:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3390478, 112468, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! The sepia gives it such a nice ''old timey'' feel. Also the lighting is wonderful. Good shot!</td>', 'I love this photo! The sepia gives it such a nice ''old timey'' feel. Also the lighting is wonderful. Good shot!', '2007-02-21 15:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
